(3134127, 438726, 47316, '<td valign="top">Seems like just a straight shot of someone elses art... cool find though. Works for the challenge. Could have gone with something different as far as perspective or composition so as not to just be photographing a wall.</td>', 'Seems like just a straight shot of someone elses art... cool find though. Works for the challenge. Could have gone with something different as far as perspective or composition so as not to just be photographing a wall.', '2006-12-20 03:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
