(3134133, 440183, 49109, '<td valign="top">Though it doesn''t really meet the challenge - without the explanation in brackets the subject had no relation to the title - it is a great shot. Good lighting, very good composition, crisp and clean.  Would have been perfect, if the screw in the gutter wasn''t missing</td>', 'Though it doesn''t really meet the challenge - without the explanation in brackets the subject had no relation to the title - it is a great shot. Good lighting, very good composition, crisp and clean.  Would have been perfect, if the screw in the gutter wasn''t missing', '2006-12-20 03:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134136, 440668, 47316, '<td valign="top">I like where you were going. Which the composition was a little different... perhaps to see the ends of the ribbons. A shot like this would really benefit from a person as the subject. Fits the title well.</td>', 'I like where you were going. Which the composition was a little different... perhaps to see the ends of the ribbons. A shot like this would really benefit from a person as the subject. Fits the title well.', '2006-12-20 03:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
