(3134144, 438190, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cool concept. The fact that you can see the flashlight patterns ruins it for me. Perhaps you could have had a longer exposure and moved the light around so it''s more ambient.</td>', 'Cool concept. The fact that you can see the flashlight patterns ruins it for me. Perhaps you could have had a longer exposure and moved the light around so it''s more ambient.', '2006-12-20 03:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134145, 440649, 49109, '<td valign="top">makes no sense to me to go out with a light in the bright daylight. And why does she push a branch at the bottom while looking upwards? Lights are blown, don''t like the cropped left arm and right thumb, too.</td>', 'makes no sense to me to go out with a light in the bright daylight. And why does she push a branch at the bottom while looking upwards? Lights are blown, don''t like the cropped left arm and right thumb, too.', '2006-12-20 03:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
