(3134642, 439203, 69183, '<td valign="top">I like the symbolism, but I think the colour balance could be altered to make this a much stronger photo.</td>', 'I like the symbolism, but I think the colour balance could be altered to make this a much stronger photo.', '2006-12-20 07:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134647, 440539, 69183, '<td valign="top">The hills are really dark and the dam itself is also too much in the shadows. I think the view down to the dam takes away much of the power that something like this can evoke. If you shot from below the dam looking up toward it, it would really dominate the shot and seem much more powerful.</td>', 'The hills are really dark and the dam itself is also too much in the shadows. I think the view down to the dam takes away much of the power that something like this can evoke. If you shot from below the dam looking up toward it, it would really dominate the shot and seem much more powerful.', '2006-12-20 07:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134653, 439328, 69183, '<td valign="top">This looks like a snapshot; the sky is very overexposed and the dogs noses are dark and lacking detail.</td>', 'This looks like a snapshot; the sky is very overexposed and the dogs noses are dark and lacking detail.', '2006-12-20 07:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134655, 440387, 48298, '<td valign="top">Creative take on this!  (Weren''t you wishing it was more than Basic Editing...could''ve gone crazy cloning on this song.) Good composition and I like how you have her looking at the book while he looks at the camera.</td>', 'Creative take on this!  (Weren''t you wishing it was more than Basic Editing...could''ve gone crazy cloning on this song.) Good composition and I like how you have her looking at the book while he looks at the camera.', '2006-12-20 07:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134656, 440477, 69183, '<td valign="top">This is well framed. I think it''s a pity that the bird is heading away rather than toward the camera tho.</td>', 'This is well framed. I think it''s a pity that the bird is heading away rather than toward the camera tho.', '2006-12-20 07:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134660, 440366, 69183, '<td valign="top">This is very noisy, particularly the lower left corner. Maybe use less JPEG compression and increase the file size when saving.</td>', 'This is very noisy, particularly the lower left corner. Maybe use less JPEG compression and increase the file size when saving.', '2006-12-20 08:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134662, 440058, 48298, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I was wishing we had a meat grinder.  Dang you.  :)  Very funny and good job matching up the color of the meat to the Barbie dress.</td>', 'LOL!  I was wishing we had a meat grinder.  Dang you.  :)  Very funny and good job matching up the color of the meat to the Barbie dress.', '2006-12-20 08:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134665, 440522, 69183, '<td valign="top">This didn''t do anything for me - sorry. The ground isn''t level but isn''t on enough of an angle to seem like it''s been done deliberately. Maybe walking around the field a bit to get a level shot and remove or hide the second building would have been better. The two specks in the top right corner are either dust specks or birds, but either way are distracting.</td>', 'This didn''t do anything for me - sorry. The ground isn''t level but isn''t on enough of an angle to seem like it''s been done deliberately. Maybe walking around the field a bit to get a level shot and remove or hide the second building would have been better. The two specks in the top right corner are either dust specks or birds, but either way are distracting.', '2006-12-20 08:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134667, 439486, 69183, '<td valign="top">The horizon is slightly off level, but not enough to suggest it''s deliberate, and the whole shot is a bit flat.</td>', 'The horizon is slightly off level, but not enough to suggest it''s deliberate, and the whole shot is a bit flat.', '2006-12-20 08:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134671, 440183, 69183, '<td valign="top">Really nice; I like the interpretation :)</td>', 'Really nice; I like the interpretation :)', '2006-12-20 08:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134672, 440605, 69183, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot! I think this''ll get some poor marks from those who say it doesn''t directly relate to PF, but I think it''s marvellous.</td>', 'Fantastic shot! I think this''ll get some poor marks from those who say it doesn''t directly relate to PF, but I think it''s marvellous.', '2006-12-20 08:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134673, 440058, 69183, '<td valign="top">Very surreal - nice one!</td>', 'Very surreal - nice one!', '2006-12-20 08:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134678, 440648, 48298, '<td valign="top">I like how you saw the light and shadows.  Color and composition is very pretty, too.  Nice work.</td>', 'I like how you saw the light and shadows.  Color and composition is very pretty, too.  Nice work.', '2006-12-20 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134687, 439471, 66733, '<td valign="top">that blurr on the left is pretty distracting... is it a bird ?</td>', 'that blurr on the left is pretty distracting... is it a bird ?', '2006-12-20 08:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134694, 440303, 48298, '<td valign="top">Kind of strange sharpness, but my camera does these weird zigzags on landscapes, too, so I won''t beat you up over it!  I like the overall mood and odd color cast on this.  Cool contrasts.</td>', 'Kind of strange sharpness, but my camera does these weird zigzags on landscapes, too, so I won''t beat you up over it!  I like the overall mood and odd color cast on this.  Cool contrasts.', '2006-12-20 08:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134703, 439844, 48298, '<td valign="top">I''m a farm girl, so I''m digging this!  :) Good job getting his tongue hanging out!  (Are you raising Piggy as a pet, or are we all having him for ham?) I like how you made a negative.  10 from me!</td>', 'I''m a farm girl, so I''m digging this!  :) Good job getting his tongue hanging out!  (Are you raising Piggy as a pet, or are we all having him for ham?) I like how you made a negative.  10 from me!', '2006-12-20 08:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134708, 440383, 48298, '<td valign="top">OK, I need to learn from you pros on how to get this look.  Stunning! Is it curves?  Anyways, beautiful presentation.  Good luck!</td>', 'OK, I need to learn from you pros on how to get this look.  Stunning! Is it curves?  Anyways, beautiful presentation.  Good luck!', '2006-12-20 08:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134717, 440343, 48298, '<td valign="top">Sheesh...you really went ALL out!  Gotta'' give you a ten...a lot of work went into this and I hope everyone appreciates it.</td>', 'Sheesh...you really went ALL out!  Gotta'' give you a ten...a lot of work went into this and I hope everyone appreciates it.', '2006-12-20 08:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134759, 438942, 66709, '<td valign="top">awesome shot</td>', 'awesome shot', '2006-12-20 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134765, 440463, 66709, '<td valign="top">awesome shot with picture you did raise the standard for all the other shots</td>', 'awesome shot with picture you did raise the standard for all the other shots', '2006-12-20 08:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134773, 438882, 66709, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it!</td>', 'I don''t get it!', '2006-12-20 08:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134776, 440352, 7485, '<td valign="top">You caught a good one! The subtle colors are nice, this is just the kind of shot many would have been tempted to pump up saturation, but you got it just right. Just wish you''d cropped out that distracting light in the bottom right corner.</td>', 'You caught a good one! The subtle colors are nice, this is just the kind of shot many would have been tempted to pump up saturation, but you got it just right. Just wish you''d cropped out that distracting light in the bottom right corner.', '2006-12-20 08:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134799, 440456, 19959, '<td valign="top">LOL... excellent take on the lyrics... should ribbon IMO.</td>', 'LOL... excellent take on the lyrics... should ribbon IMO.', '2006-12-20 08:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134800, 440590, 19959, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2006-12-20 08:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134820, 440183, 19959, '<td valign="top">Graphically and technically superb. <br/> <br/>I like the interpretation of the challenge... symbolic and perfectly realized.. this should win.. but, I can''t help thinking that it needs a closer correlation to the challenge... does it really fit ''the final cut'' title....<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Graphically and technically superb.  I like the interpretation of the challenge... symbolic and perfectly realized.. this should win.. but, I can''t help thinking that it needs a closer correlation to the challenge... does it really fit ''the final cut'' title....   Good luck...', '2006-12-20 08:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134901, 439737, 9690, '<td valign="top">Too bad his eyes aren''t green!  Great use of color.</td>', 'Too bad his eyes aren''t green!  Great use of color.', '2006-12-20 09:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134903, 440609, 9690, '<td valign="top">This is just a magnificent sports shot.  The sharp focus on your subject is stunning.  I think it is a bad interpretation of a Pink Floyd song, but the photo is amazing.</td>', 'This is just a magnificent sports shot.  The sharp focus on your subject is stunning.  I think it is a bad interpretation of a Pink Floyd song, but the photo is amazing.', '2006-12-20 09:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134904, 439737, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice positioning of the subject(s) in your composition.  I understand your decision to "desat" and enhance the greens, however, the green in some of the money now looks unnaturally bright.  Clever idea, fair execution.  JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice positioning of the subject(s) in your composition.  I understand your decision to "desat" and enhance the greens, however, the green in some of the money now looks unnaturally bright.  Clever idea, fair execution.  JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-20 09:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134912, 440480, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great abstract.  I think this would have suited the Floyd well.  Escpecially in that early period.  9</td>', 'Very nice.  Great abstract.  I think this would have suited the Floyd well.  Escpecially in that early period.  9', '2006-12-20 09:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134913, 440327, 33672, '<td valign="top">excellent job!</td>', 'excellent job!', '2006-12-20 09:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134915, 440610, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great photo and title that made me laugh... Very Hard.....</td>', 'Great photo and title that made me laugh... Very Hard.....', '2006-12-20 09:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134918, 439890, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot.  I like the lines in this, including the unintentional diagonal created by the dark shadow.  I do think for the selected title ("money") that this is a bit too abstract - need to show more of the money IMO.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice macro shot.  I like the lines in this, including the unintentional diagonal created by the dark shadow.  I do think for the selected title ("money") that this is a bit too abstract - need to show more of the money IMO.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-20 09:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134919, 439410, 9690, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract 8</td>', 'Beautiful abstract 8', '2006-12-20 09:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134921, 440037, 29293, '<td valign="top">oh i love this composition 10 such balance</td>', 'oh i love this composition 10 such balance', '2006-12-20 09:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134923, 439000, 30049, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like how you captured the reflection on the guitar.  Nicely done in that regard.  I do with that the temperature wasn''t quite so "warm" on this - a little too much yellow/red IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I REALLY like how you captured the reflection on the guitar.  Nicely done in that regard.  I do with that the temperature wasn''t quite so "warm" on this - a little too much yellow/red IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-20 09:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134925, 440399, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice light</td>', 'nice light', '2006-12-20 09:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134931, 439172, 39057, '<td valign="top">One of the greatest lyrics ever written. Goes well with the shot.</td>', 'One of the greatest lyrics ever written. Goes well with the shot.', '2006-12-20 09:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134932, 440146, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice perspective adds interest</td>', 'nice perspective adds interest', '2006-12-20 09:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134933, 440327, 9690, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhh... you are familiar with the Pink Floyd art style of the late 80''s / early 90''s.  This would have fit well with the artwork that went with The Division Bell.  Either you know this, or just got it right on accident.  Either way, I''ll give you a 10, cause I''m impressed.</td>', 'Ahhhhhh... you are familiar with the Pink Floyd art style of the late 80''s / early 90''s.  This would have fit well with the artwork that went with The Division Bell.  Either you know this, or just got it right on accident.  Either way, I''ll give you a 10, cause I''m impressed.', '2006-12-20 09:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134935, 439538, 29293, '<td valign="top">i wish it was vertical</td>', 'i wish it was vertical', '2006-12-20 09:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134940, 439567, 39057, '<td valign="top">How you got the boat to hold still is beyond me !</td>', 'How you got the boat to hold still is beyond me !', '2006-12-20 09:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3134951, 440487, 39057, '<td valign="top">...remember how she said we would meet again some sunny day....</td>', '...remember how she said we would meet again some sunny day....', '2006-12-20 09:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135015, 440599, 11854, '<td valign="top">Awesome job! 10</td>', 'Awesome job! 10', '2006-12-20 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135016, 440487, 11854, '<td valign="top">Creepy! I love that song. 10</td>', 'Creepy! I love that song. 10', '2006-12-20 09:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135020, 440650, 11854, '<td valign="top">Totally Wow! I hope you tell how you acheived this after the challenge! 10</td>', 'Totally Wow! I hope you tell how you acheived this after the challenge! 10', '2006-12-20 09:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135025, 440629, 11854, '<td valign="top">Awesome job! I hope you tell how you did this after the challenge! 10</td>', 'Awesome job! I hope you tell how you did this after the challenge! 10', '2006-12-20 09:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135082, 438942, 50641, '<td valign="top">Fits the lyric and is stand-alone gorgeous.</td>', 'Fits the lyric and is stand-alone gorgeous.', '2006-12-20 10:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135119, 439962, 28261, '<td valign="top">If only the cat had been more in focus, this would be a 10 from me.  Great work with all the elements! The slim white line on upper left is distracting, but not out of the norm if you are a fan of Storm''s work.  9</td>', 'If only the cat had been more in focus, this would be a 10 from me.  Great work with all the elements! The slim white line on upper left is distracting, but not out of the norm if you are a fan of Storm''s work.  9', '2006-12-20 10:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135130, 440290, 28261, '<td valign="top">Nice choice with the b/w and pseudo-high-key exposure on the legs.  This ''feels'' Animals.  Great job.  8</td>', 'Nice choice with the b/w and pseudo-high-key exposure on the legs.  This ''feels'' Animals.  Great job.  8', '2006-12-20 10:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135155, 440650, 28261, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Can''t wait to see how you pulled this one off.  Absolutely a winner in my book.  This could be the next album cover or book insert!  10</td>', 'Wow.  Can''t wait to see how you pulled this one off.  Absolutely a winner in my book.  This could be the next album cover or book insert!  10', '2006-12-20 10:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135270, 440662, 23484, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.  I like the processing on this one.</td>', 'Neat shot.  I like the processing on this one.', '2006-12-20 10:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135324, 439254, 7786, '<td valign="top">Interesting to see how this was done. Exellent work.</td>', 'Interesting to see how this was done. Exellent work.', '2006-12-20 11:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135337, 440654, 49737, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I''m not sure how many people will get the symbolism, unfortunately.  I''m probably underestimating, though.  Good-luck!</td>', 'Nice photo, but I''m not sure how many people will get the symbolism, unfortunately.  I''m probably underestimating, though.  Good-luck!', '2006-12-20 11:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135343, 439966, 35994, '<td valign="top">LOL, fantastic! Anyone that knows pink floyd knows this lyric. Good representation!!</td>', 'LOL, fantastic! Anyone that knows pink floyd knows this lyric. Good representation!!', '2006-12-20 11:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135369, 440609, 49737, '<td valign="top">Indoor-rinks aren''t normally what comes to mind when I think of "thin ice".  I also think a tigher, possibly vertical, crop might have done moreto draw focus to the central player--although it''s also very distracting with the player right behind him.  A closer crop would also make the face proportionally larger, which would be good since you did a good job capturing his focus.</td>', 'Indoor-rinks aren''t normally what comes to mind when I think of "thin ice".  I also think a tigher, possibly vertical, crop might have done moreto draw focus to the central player--although it''s also very distracting with the player right behind him.  A closer crop would also make the face proportionally larger, which would be good since you did a good job capturing his focus.', '2006-12-20 11:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135502, 440327, 28261, '<td valign="top">Profoundly Floyd!  Storm would be proud.  Ribbon in the making! Wish I could give this a 20!</td>', 'Profoundly Floyd!  Storm would be proud.  Ribbon in the making! Wish I could give this a 20!', '2006-12-20 11:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135542, 440460, 31403, '<td valign="top">this should do better than it will - this is great work that I bet doesn''t meet the DPC voter''s vision of "great photography" but it is.<br/> <br/>Worthy of an album cover to be sure.  Great work.</td>', 'this should do better than it will - this is great work that I bet doesn''t meet the DPC voter''s vision of "great photography" but it is. Worthy of an album cover to be sure.  Great work.', '2006-12-20 12:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135552, 440343, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is so cool but for the giant hands.  White cotton gloves would have been much more subtle, much more "pink floyd".  but everything else is a home run - great work - 9</td>', 'this is so cool but for the giant hands.  White cotton gloves would have been much more subtle, much more "pink floyd".  but everything else is a home run - great work - 9', '2006-12-20 12:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135558, 440463, 31403, '<td valign="top">wow on every level - I hope the voters embrace this as much as I think they will!  great work, if it were up to me you get the blue</td>', 'wow on every level - I hope the voters embrace this as much as I think they will!  great work, if it were up to me you get the blue', '2006-12-20 12:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135752, 440366, 50695, '<td valign="top">the diamond''s not crazy enough, but I have a high tolerance for crazy. nice composition, though.</td>', 'the diamond''s not crazy enough, but I have a high tolerance for crazy. nice composition, though.', '2006-12-20 12:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135776, 440383, 50695, '<td valign="top">that looks like a sun. didn''t I see this shot in the sky challenge?</td>', 'that looks like a sun. didn''t I see this shot in the sky challenge?', '2006-12-20 13:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135784, 440399, 50695, '<td valign="top">this looks like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=6999" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">e301</a>. I am wowed. I''ll give it a 10 now and maybe bump it up later...</td>', 'this looks like  e301. I am wowed. I''ll give it a 10 now and maybe bump it up later...', '2006-12-20 13:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135790, 440590, 50695, '<td valign="top">the composition is derivative of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=6388" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Pedro</a>. It would be interesting to see you come up with your own composition for this shot.</td>', 'the composition is derivative of  Pedro. It would be interesting to see you come up with your own composition for this shot.', '2006-12-20 13:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135810, 439000, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice job from a real fan.</td>', 'Nice job from a real fan.', '2006-12-20 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135812, 439205, 49109, '<td valign="top">I have been wating for that the whole week, aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaarrrrrrrrrrrrgghhhhhhhhhhhhhh</td>', 'I have been wating for that the whole week, aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaarrrrrrrrrrrrgghhhhhhhhhhhhhh', '2006-12-20 13:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
