(3135838, 440387, 27373, '<td valign="top">Now thats my kind of teacher!  <br/> <br/>Okay, you''re probably going to get marked down for the "heavy" white background making it look like a cutout.  Nice idea.  Pretty well executed.</td>', 'Now thats my kind of teacher!   Okay, you''re probably going to get marked down for the "heavy" white background making it look like a cutout.  Nice idea.  Pretty well executed.', '2006-12-20 13:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135839, 440327, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that since you used what looks like a wide-radius USM you know what you are doing. (BTW, there''s a bit of a halo at the feet that''s unfortunate)  Sometimes Shadow/Highlights does that as well.  Anyway, I don''t think there are cloned sticks there, but I''m just not sure so I''m going to ask for validation.  Look for it. 8</td>', 'I''m guessing that since you used what looks like a wide-radius USM you know what you are doing. (BTW, there''s a bit of a halo at the feet that''s unfortunate)  Sometimes Shadow/Highlights does that as well.  Anyway, I don''t think there are cloned sticks there, but I''m just not sure so I''m going to ask for validation.  Look for it. 8', '2006-12-20 13:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135840, 439471, 50695, '<td valign="top">the composition is promising, but the colors are muddy, particularly the sky. and you can remove sensor dust in basic editing now.</td>', 'the composition is promising, but the colors are muddy, particularly the sky. and you can remove sensor dust in basic editing now.', '2006-12-20 13:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135845, 440590, 27373, '<td valign="top">Man, how long did it take to get that off your ears.  I haven''t heard that album in years.<br/> <br/>Well done technically.  I might''ve tried cropping it much tighter and just trying to concentrate on the face itself.</td>', 'Man, how long did it take to get that off your ears.  I haven''t heard that album in years. Well done technically.  I might''ve tried cropping it much tighter and just trying to concentrate on the face itself.', '2006-12-20 13:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
