(3135875, 439471, 9149, '<td valign="top">A dot in the sensor. New basic editing rules allow to clone that. Interesting composition, although I think the TV aerial is a bit disturbing.</td>', 'A dot in the sensor. New basic editing rules allow to clone that. Interesting composition, although I think the TV aerial is a bit disturbing.', '2006-12-20 13:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135883, 440316, 9149, '<td valign="top">A unusual and dynamic point of view. I think it would be better in sharp focus.</td>', 'A unusual and dynamic point of view. I think it would be better in sharp focus.', '2006-12-20 13:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135904, 440514, 9149, '<td valign="top">Light on the wall around the window is really nice. Maybe the sky should be cropped.</td>', 'Light on the wall around the window is really nice. Maybe the sky should be cropped.', '2006-12-20 13:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135918, 439962, 53316, '<td valign="top">Gosh I sure do love this shot.  It''s really unique and original and it <b>tells a story</b> - photos that tell a story are wonderful to look at even if they are not "technically perfect".  There are technically great shots all over the place that don''t necessarly move people''s emotions - it''s like going to a five-star resturant but having a cold and not being able to taste the food.  This photo is like going to a fast food resturant on Valentine''s Day with someone you love very much.<br/> <br/>Only thing to improve would be if there had not been a harsh line of light (something had been next to the cat to make a shadow or the cat had been closer to whatever else was creating the other shadow).</td>', 'Gosh I sure do love this shot.  It''s really unique and original and it tells a story - photos that tell a story are wonderful to look at even if they are not "technically perfect".  There are technically great shots all over the place that don''t necessarly move people''s emotions - it''s like going to a five-star resturant but having a cold and not being able to taste the food.  This photo is like going to a fast food resturant on Valentine''s Day with someone you love very much. Only thing to improve would be if there had not been a harsh line of light (something had been next to the cat to make a shadow or the cat had been closer to whatever else was creating the other shadow).', '2006-12-20 13:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135940, 439783, 28471, '<td valign="top">Good concept however I feel the bee isn''t sharp enough.</td>', 'Good concept however I feel the bee isn''t sharp enough.', '2006-12-20 13:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
