(3136212, 439835, 60614, '<td valign="top">I just love the colors in this photo.  At first I thought it needed to be crisper but after looking at it some more it is very crisp.  Nice use of the rule of thirds with the little creature looking out from what I believe to be scarves.  I like the background but I can''t help but wonder what it would look like with a solid black or solid white background.  Very creative idea and I hope it does well in the challenge.  Very fine tribute to Pink Floyd.</td>', 'I just love the colors in this photo.  At first I thought it needed to be crisper but after looking at it some more it is very crisp.  Nice use of the rule of thirds with the little creature looking out from what I believe to be scarves.  I like the background but I can''t help but wonder what it would look like with a solid black or solid white background.  Very creative idea and I hope it does well in the challenge.  Very fine tribute to Pink Floyd.', '2006-12-20 15:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
