(3137958, 439203, 67841, '<td valign="top">Aw, man... what a touching moment, title &amp; expressed feelings here.  Very emotive &amp; compelling in concept.  <br/> <br/>Technically, though, it''s rubbish (IMHO).  The flat lighting &amp; way skewed white balance are a huge irritant to me as well as the "lazy angle" perspective.  Makes me think that the scene was thrown together &amp; suddenly it''s sincerity goes out the window.  <br/> <br/>An idea like this deserves better execution!<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 5 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Aw, man... what a touching moment, title & expressed feelings here.  Very emotive & compelling in concept.   Technically, though, it''s rubbish (IMHO).  The flat lighting & way skewed white balance are a huge irritant to me as well as the "lazy angle" perspective.  Makes me think that the scene was thrown together & suddenly it''s sincerity goes out the window.   An idea like this deserves better execution! << 5 >>', '2006-12-21 02:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
