(3138491, 440327, 66353, '<td valign="top">Ribbonwinner in my book - without comparison the most "Pink Floyd''ish" picture in the challenge.</td>', 'Ribbonwinner in my book - without comparison the most "Pink Floyd''ish" picture in the challenge.', '2006-12-21 07:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138494, 440183, 66353, '<td valign="top">Excellent surrealistic picture - and perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent surrealistic picture - and perfect for the challenge.', '2006-12-21 07:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138496, 439536, 69585, '<td valign="top">stunning photograph!</td>', 'stunning photograph!', '2006-12-21 07:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138502, 440451, 69585, '<td valign="top">beautiful freedom moment!8</td>', 'beautiful freedom moment!8', '2006-12-21 07:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138507, 440387, 69585, '<td valign="top">very nice and funny!</td>', 'very nice and funny!', '2006-12-21 07:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138508, 439672, 66597, '<td valign="top">Extremely creative, and stunning lighting. What a fantastic use of mundane objects, and the border enhances this photo. My first 10 of challenge.</td>', 'Extremely creative, and stunning lighting. What a fantastic use of mundane objects, and the border enhances this photo. My first 10 of challenge.', '2006-12-21 07:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138509, 440366, 69585, '<td valign="top">wonderfull and superb close up!</td>', 'wonderfull and superb close up!', '2006-12-21 07:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138513, 440352, 69585, '<td valign="top">magnifician!</td>', 'magnifician!', '2006-12-21 08:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138519, 439786, 6999, '<td valign="top">A nice approach, and almost a nice shot; if you''d been a bit either luckier or more careful with the arrangement of the silhouetted trees, and if the background weren''t so half-light, perhaps this would do well. It has an impression of lack of sharpness to the bird silhouette. Working with odd shapes, like this - I mean the surroundings rather than the bird, requires a careful eye and some real consideration of composition, which you haven''t achieved here I''m afraid. In the end, it just looks messy.</td>', 'A nice approach, and almost a nice shot; if you''d been a bit either luckier or more careful with the arrangement of the silhouetted trees, and if the background weren''t so half-light, perhaps this would do well. It has an impression of lack of sharpness to the bird silhouette. Working with odd shapes, like this - I mean the surroundings rather than the bird, requires a careful eye and some real consideration of composition, which you haven''t achieved here I''m afraid. In the end, it just looks messy.', '2006-12-21 08:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138520, 439786, 69585, '<td valign="top">wonderful silutte and idea!</td>', 'wonderful silutte and idea!', '2006-12-21 08:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138522, 439536, 6999, '<td valign="top">With the obvious implication of a postcard, of course. It would make a successful card, I think. A well taken shot, but it lacks a real sense of punch for me personally - it''s just a competent cityscape.</td>', 'With the obvious implication of a postcard, of course. It would make a successful card, I think. A well taken shot, but it lacks a real sense of punch for me personally - it''s just a competent cityscape.', '2006-12-21 08:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138524, 440648, 6999, '<td valign="top">The slight vignetting is effective - but perhaps not effective enough? I find I''m drawn to the areas outside the concrete - where the trees are, and I''m finding nothing to hold my eye amongst those pillars and slabs of concrete. Perhaps that is your point, but it has lead to a difficult viewing experience. The idea of making nothing your subject is difficult to carry off.</td>', 'The slight vignetting is effective - but perhaps not effective enough? I find I''m drawn to the areas outside the concrete - where the trees are, and I''m finding nothing to hold my eye amongst those pillars and slabs of concrete. Perhaps that is your point, but it has lead to a difficult viewing experience. The idea of making nothing your subject is difficult to carry off.', '2006-12-21 08:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138528, 440544, 69585, '<td valign="top">so beautiful!!</td>', 'so beautiful!!', '2006-12-21 08:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138532, 440366, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lacks real detail and quality - either resolution, processing or cropping has lead to a blocky feel to this image. The composition is kind of effective - not as effective as it might be because of the green background image right, and your control of the reflections etc. in the stone is poor - to give a real sense of ping from a jewel requires careful lighting indeed.</td>', 'Lacks real detail and quality - either resolution, processing or cropping has lead to a blocky feel to this image. The composition is kind of effective - not as effective as it might be because of the green background image right, and your control of the reflections etc. in the stone is poor - to give a real sense of ping from a jewel requires careful lighting indeed.', '2006-12-21 08:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138534, 440604, 69585, '<td valign="top">great work!!</td>', 'great work!!', '2006-12-21 08:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138538, 440146, 6999, '<td valign="top">The hyper-shallow depth of field produces an intriguing effect - a slight disorientation. But the image lacks interest for me - I''m not finding the textures nor patterns interesting, and what is there beyond that, actually?</td>', 'The hyper-shallow depth of field produces an intriguing effect - a slight disorientation. But the image lacks interest for me - I''m not finding the textures nor patterns interesting, and what is there beyond that, actually?', '2006-12-21 08:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138540, 439486, 69585, '<td valign="top">wonderful landscapes!!!</td>', 'wonderful landscapes!!!', '2006-12-21 08:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138550, 438882, 9690, '<td valign="top">Wow... an almost exact copy of a cover!  I hope most will realize what you have done here... <br/> <br/>One of the better Floyd albums, too!</td>', 'Wow... an almost exact copy of a cover!  I hope most will realize what you have done here...  One of the better Floyd albums, too!', '2006-12-21 08:33:47.000000', NULL, 1);
