(3138963, 439425, 33542, '<td valign="top">Highlights are blown. I would also have had the guy tip his head up a bit more so you could see his second eye a bit.</td>', 'Highlights are blown. I would also have had the guy tip his head up a bit more so you could see his second eye a bit.', '2006-12-21 12:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138965, 439310, 56254, '<td valign="top">fantastic composition ... like the grainy feel to this one</td>', 'fantastic composition ... like the grainy feel to this one', '2006-12-21 12:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138967, 440636, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, but I think it would have been more effective with a different backdrop and if you could have seen more of the fishbowl. There are also distracting dots, maybe bubbles, in the foreground and droplets of water inside the top of the bowl.</td>', 'I like this idea, but I think it would have been more effective with a different backdrop and if you could have seen more of the fishbowl. There are also distracting dots, maybe bubbles, in the foreground and droplets of water inside the top of the bowl.', '2006-12-21 12:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138969, 440604, 56254, '<td valign="top">great idea .. wish her face was as sharp as her feet and skirt though ...</td>', 'great idea .. wish her face was as sharp as her feet and skirt though ...', '2006-12-21 12:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138971, 440304, 33542, '<td valign="top">A little too dark - or at least, contrast is too high. It''s a problem with flames.</td>', 'A little too dark - or at least, contrast is too high. It''s a problem with flames.', '2006-12-21 12:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138974, 440404, 56254, '<td valign="top">lighting is a bit harsh</td>', 'lighting is a bit harsh', '2006-12-21 12:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138977, 440456, 56254, '<td valign="top">I want to sweep that one big curl out of her face ... 7</td>', 'I want to sweep that one big curl out of her face ... 7', '2006-12-21 12:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138981, 440404, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot, however, I find the shirt/sweatshirt to be a distracting outfit choice - better to just do a plain (maybe ripped) t-shirt. Also, I''m not sure how you made the light patterns, but they''re overlapping with the model and despite the name, it''s very unclear at first glance that the black is a head shape.</td>', 'I like the idea a lot, however, I find the shirt/sweatshirt to be a distracting outfit choice - better to just do a plain (maybe ripped) t-shirt. Also, I''m not sure how you made the light patterns, but they''re overlapping with the model and despite the name, it''s very unclear at first glance that the black is a head shape.', '2006-12-21 12:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138982, 440251, 33542, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, noise.</td>', 'Out of focus, noise.', '2006-12-21 12:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138984, 439503, 33542, '<td valign="top">This might have been more effective with less of the building on the right - the flare there is distracting.</td>', 'This might have been more effective with less of the building on the right - the flare there is distracting.', '2006-12-21 12:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138985, 439422, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is brilliant - I like the british sorta school-girl looking color and shirt - Floydian IMO  I hope that was intentional.  This is where I''m going to coin the phrase "Floydian Slip" - it doesn''t really apply but I just thought it was funny.</td>', 'This is brilliant - I like the british sorta school-girl looking color and shirt - Floydian IMO  I hope that was intentional.  This is where I''m going to coin the phrase "Floydian Slip" - it doesn''t really apply but I just thought it was funny.', '2006-12-21 12:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138986, 440522, 56254, '<td valign="top">to me, the building means that it''s not really empty ... I think that this would have been a stronger photo if it were ''building free''</td>', 'to me, the building means that it''s not really empty ... I think that this would have been a stronger photo if it were ''building free''', '2006-12-21 12:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138987, 440514, 33542, '<td valign="top">This image appears tilted - it would have been better if it had been straight.</td>', 'This image appears tilted - it would have been better if it had been straight.', '2006-12-21 12:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138988, 440336, 56254, '<td valign="top">OOF</td>', 'OOF', '2006-12-21 12:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138990, 439328, 56254, '<td valign="top">blown out sky ... dogs have a blue tint to them ...</td>', 'blown out sky ... dogs have a blue tint to them ...', '2006-12-21 12:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138994, 440026, 56254, '<td valign="top">stunning ... 10</td>', 'stunning ... 10', '2006-12-21 12:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138995, 440399, 33542, '<td valign="top">I''m confused about the black on the righthand side. Also, the darks are very dark and you lose definition towards the bottom of the stairs, which may have been what you were going for, but since you can see detail again beyond that point it wasn''t all that effective. If you were implying loss of detail as you go down it might have been best to crop while in the dark part at the bottom.</td>', 'I''m confused about the black on the righthand side. Also, the darks are very dark and you lose definition towards the bottom of the stairs, which may have been what you were going for, but since you can see detail again beyond that point it wasn''t all that effective. If you were implying loss of detail as you go down it might have been best to crop while in the dark part at the bottom.', '2006-12-21 12:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138997, 440183, 38032, '<td valign="top">Simply awesome - clean, clear , great colors - just perfect ... not to mention a clever title / concept.  <br/>Virtual ribbon is in the mail.</td>', 'Simply awesome - clean, clear , great colors - just perfect ... not to mention a clever title / concept.  Virtual ribbon is in the mail.', '2006-12-21 12:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3138998, 440457, 56254, '<td valign="top">the sepia tones don''t do this photo justice ...</td>', 'the sepia tones don''t do this photo justice ...', '2006-12-21 12:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139006, 439211, 38032, '<td valign="top">It''s hard for me to grasp this. I think it needs to be more defined by the surrounding elements -  Shine on you crazy cookie-tray.</td>', 'It''s hard for me to grasp this. I think it needs to be more defined by the surrounding elements -  Shine on you crazy cookie-tray.', '2006-12-21 12:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139009, 439966, 63006, '<td valign="top">I love it! great expression of being caught, and I think the black and white makes it even better. 10</td>', 'I love it! great expression of being caught, and I think the black and white makes it even better. 10', '2006-12-21 12:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139012, 440629, 63006, '<td valign="top">this one is interesting for sure.. i like it, but not sure that i like it. 6</td>', 'this one is interesting for sure.. i like it, but not sure that i like it. 6', '2006-12-21 12:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139015, 440480, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great abstract with nice colors</td>', 'Great abstract with nice colors', '2006-12-21 12:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139016, 440649, 63006, '<td valign="top">I like this one because I like the song mostly, but it is a good capture.. I''m sure you''ve already heard it or will hear it, but the clothing is a little too bright. Oh well though, and I''m not sure that the pine boughs closer to you that are out of focus really help the picture at all, they were kind of distracting. Overall, a good shot. 9</td>', 'I like this one because I like the song mostly, but it is a good capture.. I''m sure you''ve already heard it or will hear it, but the clothing is a little too bright. Oh well though, and I''m not sure that the pine boughs closer to you that are out of focus really help the picture at all, they were kind of distracting. Overall, a good shot. 9', '2006-12-21 12:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139017, 440037, 56254, '<td valign="top">amazing interpretation of ''echoes'' ... 10</td>', 'amazing interpretation of ''echoes'' ... 10', '2006-12-21 12:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139018, 440288, 56254, '<td valign="top">very grainy ...</td>', 'very grainy ...', '2006-12-21 12:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139022, 440041, 56254, '<td valign="top">I like the photo a lot ... but IMHO this really doesn''t say "empty" to me ... nonetheless ... 7</td>', 'I like the photo a lot ... but IMHO this really doesn''t say "empty" to me ... nonetheless ... 7', '2006-12-21 12:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139023, 439373, 56254, '<td valign="top">wow ... well done .. 9</td>', 'wow ... well done .. 9', '2006-12-21 12:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139026, 440343, 38032, '<td valign="top">This makes me think of primus for some reason - The cage thing is just bizarre - I can''t tell if this is life-size.  Just random thoughts I suppose - it''s defintely intriguing and fits the Pink Floyd theme - the only thing I might alter would be the composition.</td>', 'This makes me think of primus for some reason - The cage thing is just bizarre - I can''t tell if this is life-size.  Just random thoughts I suppose - it''s defintely intriguing and fits the Pink Floyd theme - the only thing I might alter would be the composition.', '2006-12-21 12:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139033, 440649, 56254, '<td valign="top">why does she have a lantern in the middle of the day?</td>', 'why does she have a lantern in the middle of the day?', '2006-12-21 12:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139038, 440277, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like the artsy thing here.  Very dark and depressing - I think that''s pretty much how Floyd is. 7</td>', 'I like the artsy thing here.  Very dark and depressing - I think that''s pretty much how Floyd is. 7', '2006-12-21 12:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139045, 440641, 56254, '<td valign="top">don''t care for the composition here ...</td>', 'don''t care for the composition here ...', '2006-12-21 12:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
