(3139169, 440610, 26001, '<td valign="top">hahahaha</td>', 'hahahaha', '2006-12-21 13:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139378, 439110, 33542, '<td valign="top">It wouldn''t accept my comment a minute ago so let me try again (sorry if you get two).<br/> <br/>There''s a lot of noise - NeatImage would probably have helped. I would also have cropped out the tree on the righthand side, and possibly have cropped the bottom a bit more b/c the reflections are distracting. Finally, I think it would have been nicer if the contrast were boosted a bit.</td>', 'It wouldn''t accept my comment a minute ago so let me try again (sorry if you get two). There''s a lot of noise - NeatImage would probably have helped. I would also have cropped out the tree on the righthand side, and possibly have cropped the bottom a bit more b/c the reflections are distracting. Finally, I think it would have been nicer if the contrast were boosted a bit.', '2006-12-21 14:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139390, 440456, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot - my only complaint is the lighter area in the bottom right.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot - my only complaint is the lighter area in the bottom right.', '2006-12-21 14:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139400, 439737, 33542, '<td valign="top">I thought I had already commented on this picture, but it came up again so maybe it didn''t accept my first comment.<br/> <br/>The model looks too happy, imo, or actually the wrong kind of happy, for the mood of this picture - like he''s part of an after school special or on mood enhancers. I think it would have been better with a slightly crazed look or something. Just my opinion, though.</td>', 'I thought I had already commented on this picture, but it came up again so maybe it didn''t accept my first comment. The model looks too happy, imo, or actually the wrong kind of happy, for the mood of this picture - like he''s part of an after school special or on mood enhancers. I think it would have been better with a slightly crazed look or something. Just my opinion, though.', '2006-12-21 14:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139419, 440327, 33542, '<td valign="top">This is the most clever photo I''ve seen so far... how''d you get the "hands" to float in the air like that? String? Throw them? That having been said, There are a couple of problems w/ the photo. I feel it has been oversharpened b/c there is - I don''t know what it''s called - the little dots of noise in the sky. Also, the waves look a little "squared off," and the water is lighter in color between the legs, which is probably a residual from the sharpening. Finally, the picture gives me the impression of being tilted, even though the horizon is approximately straight, because the land is at an angle.</td>', 'This is the most clever photo I''ve seen so far... how''d you get the "hands" to float in the air like that? String? Throw them? That having been said, There are a couple of problems w/ the photo. I feel it has been oversharpened b/c there is - I don''t know what it''s called - the little dots of noise in the sky. Also, the waves look a little "squared off," and the water is lighter in color between the legs, which is probably a residual from the sharpening. Finally, the picture gives me the impression of being tilted, even though the horizon is approximately straight, because the land is at an angle.', '2006-12-21 15:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139421, 439847, 33542, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this picture fits the title.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this picture fits the title.', '2006-12-21 15:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139424, 440041, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but I think the contrast is a little too high - the right side is too dark and outside the highlights are blown. Perhaps you were trying to portray empty space, but I think you still could have used a reflector so we could at least see the whole of the woman''s face.</td>', 'I like this photo, but I think the contrast is a little too high - the right side is too dark and outside the highlights are blown. Perhaps you were trying to portray empty space, but I think you still could have used a reflector so we could at least see the whole of the woman''s face.', '2006-12-21 15:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139428, 439000, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection in the guitar a lot. There seems to be a yellow color cast to the photo, though. Also, there''s something about the crop that''s not totally pleasing to me - it doesn''t really comport with the law of thirds. Finally, there are some distracting elements in the background (carpet and something on the wall.</td>', 'I like the reflection in the guitar a lot. There seems to be a yellow color cast to the photo, though. Also, there''s something about the crop that''s not totally pleasing to me - it doesn''t really comport with the law of thirds. Finally, there are some distracting elements in the background (carpet and something on the wall.', '2006-12-21 15:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139430, 440539, 33542, '<td valign="top">The lighting is not ideal here - the dam and hillside are too much in shadow. You may have been able to help this in PS.</td>', 'The lighting is not ideal here - the dam and hillside are too much in shadow. You may have been able to help this in PS.', '2006-12-21 15:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139437, 440457, 33542, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing dogs of war, but didn''t have any war paraphenalia laying around  :)  I don''t love the color palate here, I think less yellow would have been better. A blank wall might have been better than the curtains as a backdrop, too. Also, I know dogs are hard to control, but I would have liked to see him looking at the camera.</td>', 'I thought about doing dogs of war, but didn''t have any war paraphenalia laying around  :)  I don''t love the color palate here, I think less yellow would have been better. A blank wall might have been better than the curtains as a backdrop, too. Also, I know dogs are hard to control, but I would have liked to see him looking at the camera.', '2006-12-21 15:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139447, 440490, 33542, '<td valign="top">Did you desaturate? I might have desaturated the red channel b/c there is a pinkish tint to a couple of the white squares. I''m curious why you did just the legs and why you did this angle, too. I would have liked to see the whole boys.</td>', 'Did you desaturate? I might have desaturated the red channel b/c there is a pinkish tint to a couple of the white squares. I''m curious why you did just the legs and why you did this angle, too. I would have liked to see the whole boys.', '2006-12-21 15:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139451, 438560, 33542, '<td valign="top">He does look a little paranoid  :)<br/>I like the eyebrow thing, but I would have liked to see more of the other eye.</td>', 'He does look a little paranoid  :)I like the eyebrow thing, but I would have liked to see more of the other eye.', '2006-12-21 15:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139453, 440366, 33542, '<td valign="top">Not really in focus. I think you were too close or you cropped too much.</td>', 'Not really in focus. I think you were too close or you cropped too much.', '2006-12-21 15:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139457, 440480, 33542, '<td valign="top">No idea what Astronomy Domine means... the picture is pretty, but I would have liked to be able to tell what something in it was. Maybe something in focus in the foreground with colors like this in the background?</td>', 'No idea what Astronomy Domine means... the picture is pretty, but I would have liked to be able to tell what something in it was. Maybe something in focus in the foreground with colors like this in the background?', '2006-12-21 15:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139459, 439838, 33542, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand how the title fits this picture, but that aside, the picture has quite a bit of noise and the colors are a little dull. Try NeatImage and a saturation boost.</td>', 'I don''t really understand how the title fits this picture, but that aside, the picture has quite a bit of noise and the colors are a little dull. Try NeatImage and a saturation boost.', '2006-12-21 15:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139465, 438726, 33542, '<td valign="top">The picture is a little tilted, I think. There might be a little oversharpening, too, as evidenced by the glow in the blue section next to the roof. I''m also not 100% sure how the title pertains to the picture, but it is an interesting subject. Too bad it was basic editing or I woudl have suggested you get rid of the red pole in the front.</td>', 'The picture is a little tilted, I think. There might be a little oversharpening, too, as evidenced by the glow in the blue section next to the roof. I''m also not 100% sure how the title pertains to the picture, but it is an interesting subject. Too bad it was basic editing or I woudl have suggested you get rid of the red pole in the front.', '2006-12-21 15:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139469, 440460, 33542, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a little bit more DOF, but overall I like this photo a lot.</td>', 'I would have liked a little bit more DOF, but overall I like this photo a lot.', '2006-12-21 15:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139481, 440277, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot. Too bad we lost nearly all of the detail of her hair, though, due to the high contrast/darkness at the top. I also don''t love the surface you picked for the photo. Something in a totally different color palate from her skin would have been better, imo.</td>', 'I like this idea a lot. Too bad we lost nearly all of the detail of her hair, though, due to the high contrast/darkness at the top. I also don''t love the surface you picked for the photo. Something in a totally different color palate from her skin would have been better, imo.', '2006-12-21 15:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139491, 440610, 33542, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2006-12-21 15:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139499, 440528, 33542, '<td valign="top">Appears simultaneously soft focus and oversharpened.</td>', 'Appears simultaneously soft focus and oversharpened.', '2006-12-21 15:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139501, 440486, 33542, '<td valign="top">Good job getting a totally white background. There does seem to be some noise on teh guy''s shirt, and some glow low on the horizon (from sharpening?) but overall pretty good.</td>', 'Good job getting a totally white background. There does seem to be some noise on teh guy''s shirt, and some glow low on the horizon (from sharpening?) but overall pretty good.', '2006-12-21 15:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139502, 439486, 33542, '<td valign="top">pretty colors, but nothing overly special about this shot. Would have been better with something in the picture besides water and sky, like a lighthouse or boat or something.</td>', 'pretty colors, but nothing overly special about this shot. Would have been better with something in the picture besides water and sky, like a lighthouse or boat or something.', '2006-12-21 15:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139504, 440477, 33542, '<td valign="top">Cute idea - only annoying thing is the tree on the bottom, which I''m sure you would have edited out if it hadn''t been basic.</td>', 'Cute idea - only annoying thing is the tree on the bottom, which I''m sure you would have edited out if it hadn''t been basic.', '2006-12-21 15:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139508, 439844, 33542, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like this shot. I know it''s artistic, etc, but it''s just not a pleasing picture to me.</td>', 'I really don''t like this shot. I know it''s artistic, etc, but it''s just not a pleasing picture to me.', '2006-12-21 15:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
