(3139521, 439422, 33542, '<td valign="top">Lighting could be a little better - flare off the knife is annoying and it''s hard to see the details around her eyes. The crop is good, though.</td>', 'Lighting could be a little better - flare off the knife is annoying and it''s hard to see the details around her eyes. The crop is good, though.', '2006-12-21 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139525, 440604, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. Suggestions - focus her face is a bit soft, possibly from holding still for so long during the exposure. I would have liked to see the three "lunatics" be a little more solid - i.e. more exposure time for each. Overall good, though.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. Suggestions - focus her face is a bit soft, possibly from holding still for so long during the exposure. I would have liked to see the three "lunatics" be a little more solid - i.e. more exposure time for each. Overall good, though.', '2006-12-21 15:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139526, 440288, 33542, '<td valign="top">I love the skeleton.</td>', 'I love the skeleton.', '2006-12-21 15:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139527, 440164, 33542, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft</td>', 'Focus is a little soft', '2006-12-21 15:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139530, 440146, 33542, '<td valign="top">Extremely small DOF here makes wall seem curved - kind of disconcerting, but I can see the artiness if you planned it. I''m not sure about the presence of whatever that metal thing is at the top, though.</td>', 'Extremely small DOF here makes wall seem curved - kind of disconcerting, but I can see the artiness if you planned it. I''m not sure about the presence of whatever that metal thing is at the top, though.', '2006-12-21 15:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139531, 440253, 33542, '<td valign="top">Focus is a littl soft and saturation seems unnatural, but nice colors.</td>', 'Focus is a littl soft and saturation seems unnatural, but nice colors.', '2006-12-21 15:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139534, 439310, 33542, '<td valign="top">I don''t love the amount of noise, but I could see how it might be an artistic choice.</td>', 'I don''t love the amount of noise, but I could see how it might be an artistic choice.', '2006-12-21 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139538, 440530, 33542, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t mind that the girl is so dark, but it wouldn''t hurt to have had another light of some sort illuminating her face a bit more. Also, I feel like I''m looking up her skirt - maybe pants or a different angle.</td>', 'I personally don''t mind that the girl is so dark, but it wouldn''t hurt to have had another light of some sort illuminating her face a bit more. Also, I feel like I''m looking up her skirt - maybe pants or a different angle.', '2006-12-21 15:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139544, 439567, 33542, '<td valign="top">The problem with such long exposures, of course, is the ambient light. I would have liked to see you boost the contrast to make the sky a little darker, even if it meant losing definition on the boat. I''m also a little confused why the trails are different colors - are they not stars?</td>', 'The problem with such long exposures, of course, is the ambient light. I would have liked to see you boost the contrast to make the sky a little darker, even if it meant losing definition on the boat. I''m also a little confused why the trails are different colors - are they not stars?', '2006-12-21 15:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139548, 440642, 33542, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few shots I''ve seen that effectively uses a small DOF. Good job.</td>', 'This is one of the few shots I''ve seen that effectively uses a small DOF. Good job.', '2006-12-21 15:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139550, 440147, 33542, '<td valign="top">Nipple features a little more prominently than I would have preferred  :)</td>', 'Nipple features a little more prominently than I would have preferred  :)', '2006-12-21 15:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139556, 440378, 33542, '<td valign="top">You effectively portrayed the sentiment here, I think, with the color choice. I like the vertical orientation. My only suggestion might have been to make it more square to show more "empty space" water.</td>', 'You effectively portrayed the sentiment here, I think, with the color choice. I like the vertical orientation. My only suggestion might have been to make it more square to show more "empty space" water.', '2006-12-21 15:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139557, 440451, 33542, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more space beneath the bird.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more space beneath the bird.', '2006-12-21 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139562, 439254, 33542, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot - I''m having some trouble imagining how you did it, though.</td>', 'Very cool shot - I''m having some trouble imagining how you did it, though.', '2006-12-21 15:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139564, 440662, 33542, '<td valign="top">Would have been cooler if you could actually see the reflection of flames in the eyes rather than just white dots.</td>', 'Would have been cooler if you could actually see the reflection of flames in the eyes rather than just white dots.', '2006-12-21 15:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139568, 439966, 33542, '<td valign="top">Too "NeatImaged" for me, personally, even as an artistic statement - kind of gives me the creeps.</td>', 'Too "NeatImaged" for me, personally, even as an artistic statement - kind of gives me the creeps.', '2006-12-21 15:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
