(3139609, 440463, 33542, '<td valign="top">To me the sky is a little bit overexposed, but I understand why in order to catch a few details on the man. This might have been fixable with tone mapping, but I don''t know how to do it, so I''m not sure.</td>', 'To me the sky is a little bit overexposed, but I understand why in order to catch a few details on the man. This might have been fixable with tone mapping, but I don''t know how to do it, so I''m not sure.', '2006-12-21 16:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
