(3139833, 439486, 7786, '<td valign="top">Good colors. When a water horizont is not totally horizontal you get the feeling that the water will start rushing to the left side. I would alos recomend you not to compress the picture this much. JPEG artifacts can be seen where water and sky meet, try optimizing JPEG compression so that you use as much of the 150kb you are allowed.</td>', 'Good colors. When a water horizont is not totally horizontal you get the feeling that the water will start rushing to the left side. I would alos recomend you not to compress the picture this much. JPEG artifacts can be seen where water and sky meet, try optimizing JPEG compression so that you use as much of the 150kb you are allowed.', '2006-12-21 17:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
