(3139959, 439422, 69556, '<td valign="top">All I can say is "Hell Yeah"</td>', 'All I can say is "Hell Yeah"', '2006-12-21 17:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3139970, 440548, 69556, '<td valign="top">Love this photo! Great with the symbolism.  Excelent color!</td>', 'Love this photo! Great with the symbolism.  Excelent color!', '2006-12-21 17:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140176, 440288, 66597, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, with nice continuity via the stethoscopes. The lighting looks a bit harsh, though, and could be sharper. Mainly I think this would be stronger if the skeleton were a bit further to the left. I''m not sure the third doctor is needed. 5.</td>', 'Interesting idea, with nice continuity via the stethoscopes. The lighting looks a bit harsh, though, and could be sharper. Mainly I think this would be stronger if the skeleton were a bit further to the left. I''m not sure the third doctor is needed. 5.', '2006-12-21 19:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140180, 440378, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the sepia, and I also like the vanishing point and how the trees grow misty toward the back. I''m not sure, however, how well this fits the challenge, seems a bit "shoehorned" in, perhaps. Still, a strong photo. 6.</td>', 'I really like the sepia, and I also like the vanishing point and how the trees grow misty toward the back. I''m not sure, however, how well this fits the challenge, seems a bit "shoehorned" in, perhaps. Still, a strong photo. 6.', '2006-12-21 19:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140181, 440477, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and feeling of movement. However, I don''t feel the bird is sharp enough to stand on its own as subject.</td>', 'I like the perspective and feeling of movement. However, I don''t feel the bird is sharp enough to stand on its own as subject.', '2006-12-21 19:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140185, 440653, 66597, '<td valign="top">Weird...fits the challenge well. I''m having trouble figuring out how you did this and what the building is. Doesn''t look brick. Looks more like particle board? Good composition and use of light, but I don''t think it would have much appeal outside of this challenge. 5.</td>', 'Weird...fits the challenge well. I''m having trouble figuring out how you did this and what the building is. Doesn''t look brick. Looks more like particle board? Good composition and use of light, but I don''t think it would have much appeal outside of this challenge. 5.', '2006-12-21 19:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140186, 440519, 66597, '<td valign="top">Creative take. Not sure the composition quite works, probably due to partially cropped fish at bottom. I do like the sense of surreal. 6.</td>', 'Creative take. Not sure the composition quite works, probably due to partially cropped fish at bottom. I do like the sense of surreal. 6.', '2006-12-21 19:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140189, 439275, 66597, '<td valign="top">Although this doesn''t say "pink floyd" to me, I think it is an interesting shot, just the same. Looks like it may have been a tad over-shapened around a couple of the birds.</td>', 'Although this doesn''t say "pink floyd" to me, I think it is an interesting shot, just the same. Looks like it may have been a tad over-shapened around a couple of the birds.', '2006-12-21 19:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140192, 439425, 66597, '<td valign="top">My first thought was Jack Nicholson in "The Shining." Expression is great. Technically, though, I think the harsh white sky detracts from the face, and the composition could be a bit stronger. 5.</td>', 'My first thought was Jack Nicholson in "The Shining." Expression is great. Technically, though, I think the harsh white sky detracts from the face, and the composition could be a bit stronger. 5.', '2006-12-21 19:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140201, 440041, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is a beautiful image that works very well both in and out of this challenge. The blown highlights IMO actually serve to enhance instead of detract, which is most unusual. This one "speaks" to me very clearly. 10.</td>', 'Wow. This is a beautiful image that works very well both in and out of this challenge. The blown highlights IMO actually serve to enhance instead of detract, which is most unusual. This one "speaks" to me very clearly. 10.', '2006-12-21 19:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140204, 440040, 66597, '<td valign="top">Oh, if only the branches were sharply focused, I would love this. As it is, I find them distracting. However, excellent capture of a sliver of moon. 5.</td>', 'Oh, if only the branches were sharply focused, I would love this. As it is, I find them distracting. However, excellent capture of a sliver of moon. 5.', '2006-12-21 19:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140208, 438942, 66597, '<td valign="top">OMG, this is a stunning photo. One of the best I''ve seen in a long time. The lighting is just extraordinary, the composition is strong, the DOF is perfect. Needless to say, it could stand on its own outside this challenge. I hope this gets the blue. 10+</td>', 'OMG, this is a stunning photo. One of the best I''ve seen in a long time. The lighting is just extraordinary, the composition is strong, the DOF is perfect. Needless to say, it could stand on its own outside this challenge. I hope this gets the blue. 10+', '2006-12-21 19:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140216, 440277, 66597, '<td valign="top">The lighting is great, the DOF is perfect...I''m trying to figure out why this doesn''t quite work for me. I think it is because my eye is having trouble finding a place to settle, maybe because the hair blends just a bit too seamlessly with the background, maybe because of composition. 6.</td>', 'The lighting is great, the DOF is perfect...I''m trying to figure out why this doesn''t quite work for me. I think it is because my eye is having trouble finding a place to settle, maybe because the hair blends just a bit too seamlessly with the background, maybe because of composition. 6.', '2006-12-21 19:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140218, 439844, 66597, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of negative image. Mud (or hot pixels?) actually add to this image. I think this would be stronger with selective desat on the pig (though I realize you couldn''t do that in basic). As it is, I''m looking for something to "pop" and nothing quite does. 6.</td>', 'Interesting use of negative image. Mud (or hot pixels?) actually add to this image. I think this would be stronger with selective desat on the pig (though I realize you couldn''t do that in basic). As it is, I''m looking for something to "pop" and nothing quite does. 6.', '2006-12-21 19:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3140219, 440290, 66597, '<td valign="top">The addition of collar on left dog enhances this, and I find the composition interesting. What I think might strenghten the image would be very sharp focus on the right-hand dog''s face. My eye is searching for something to focus on. 6.</td>', 'The addition of collar on left dog enhances this, and I find the composition interesting. What I think might strenghten the image would be very sharp focus on the right-hand dog''s face. My eye is searching for something to focus on. 6.', '2006-12-21 19:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
