(3141669, 440609, 24073, '<td valign="top">I love "The Thin Ice", and tried to come up with an idea for it.  This is the thing though, BTW the photo is incredible too.  I will vote very high for the photo itself, and for the fact that the standard "meet the challenge", has been met.  But we are talking about Pink Floyd here, and Hockey just don''t fit the profile.  I''m suspecting that you will do well in the challenge because the shot was so well executed.  GL. 7.</td>', 'I love "The Thin Ice", and tried to come up with an idea for it.  This is the thing though, BTW the photo is incredible too.  I will vote very high for the photo itself, and for the fact that the standard "meet the challenge", has been met.  But we are talking about Pink Floyd here, and Hockey just don''t fit the profile.  I''m suspecting that you will do well in the challenge because the shot was so well executed.  GL. 7.', '2006-12-22 10:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3141678, 440462, 24073, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love it.  I love your decision to throw the rule of thirds out the window.  I love its simplicity, and the slightly off center approach.  The lighting is almost perfect, though a slight reflection behind the top of her head would be nice, "maybe".  GL. 8</td>', 'Wow, I love it.  I love your decision to throw the rule of thirds out the window.  I love its simplicity, and the slightly off center approach.  The lighting is almost perfect, though a slight reflection behind the top of her head would be nice, "maybe".  GL. 8', '2006-12-22 10:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
