(3142742, 439539, 27482, '<td valign="top">I bet you are getting hammered for the noise in this shot.  However I REALLY like this photo as it is presented, the composition, coloring and noise really works for me and I could not do anything else but throw a 10 on it and add to my faves.  Excellent work!</td>', 'I bet you are getting hammered for the noise in this shot.  However I REALLY like this photo as it is presented, the composition, coloring and noise really works for me and I could not do anything else but throw a 10 on it and add to my faves.  Excellent work!', '2006-12-22 16:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142744, 439310, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a little off with the composition, at least for my tastes, too centered, I would have liked it better had the tunnel been more to the left in the shot.  6 from me.</td>', 'Nice shot but a little off with the composition, at least for my tastes, too centered, I would have liked it better had the tunnel been more to the left in the shot.  6 from me.', '2006-12-22 16:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142748, 440383, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but I find this to be a little too reliant on the title to fit this challenge and I don´t get it, how is a sunset/sunrise "the dark side of the moon"?  Nice shot but I knocked off a couple of points for meeting the challenge poorly in my opinion and gave it a 4, would have voted a 6 if I thought it fit the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'I am sorry but I find this to be a little too reliant on the title to fit this challenge and I don´t get it, how is a sunset/sunrise "the dark side of the moon"?  Nice shot but I knocked off a couple of points for meeting the challenge poorly in my opinion and gave it a 4, would have voted a 6 if I thought it fit the challenge perfectly.', '2006-12-22 16:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142760, 439172, 27482, '<td valign="top">I dig tilted shot´s a lot but only when it improves the shot and I don´t really think the tilt here is doing that as my eye wanders down to the low left corner due to the tilt, not at the sky and the girl standing there.  Not a bad shot though.</td>', 'I dig tilted shot´s a lot but only when it improves the shot and I don´t really think the tilt here is doing that as my eye wanders down to the low left corner due to the tilt, not at the sky and the girl standing there.  Not a bad shot though.', '2006-12-22 16:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142762, 440336, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but if you are not deliberatly aiming for the brown ribbon, send me a PM and I´ll by all means try to help you out with at least getting a shot in focus next time, no problem :)  Hard to give this anything but a 1.</td>', 'Sorry but if you are not deliberatly aiming for the brown ribbon, send me a PM and I´ll by all means try to help you out with at least getting a shot in focus next time, no problem :)  Hard to give this anything but a 1.', '2006-12-22 16:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
