(3142776, 439590, 27482, '<td valign="top">Model is definately doing his job, however I have a problem with the lighting, too strong and the harsh shadow is kindof, well, I find the shadow "ugly" for lack of a better word.  Like the idea though and if you could improve the lighting, then we´d be talking :)</td>', 'Model is definately doing his job, however I have a problem with the lighting, too strong and the harsh shadow is kindof, well, I find the shadow "ugly" for lack of a better word.  Like the idea though and if you could improve the lighting, then we´d be talking :)', '2006-12-22 16:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142781, 440290, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but honestly, find it a bit too craped compositionally and bothers me a bit to see you cut off the feet like that, I personally would have either gone for an even tighter frame and cut off the legs at just over the knees or had them all in the frame.</td>', 'Not bad but honestly, find it a bit too craped compositionally and bothers me a bit to see you cut off the feet like that, I personally would have either gone for an even tighter frame and cut off the legs at just over the knees or had them all in the frame.', '2006-12-22 16:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142785, 440041, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, everything but the lighting, I would have moved more to the left to minimalize the blow out windof in the frame and taken the photo from directly in front of her.  That or darken the exposure and used some lighting on her to even it out but like I said, like the rest of this picture and especially the mood in it, nice work.</td>', 'I like this shot, everything but the lighting, I would have moved more to the left to minimalize the blow out windof in the frame and taken the photo from directly in front of her.  That or darken the exposure and used some lighting on her to even it out but like I said, like the rest of this picture and especially the mood in it, nice work.', '2006-12-22 16:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142788, 439737, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I just simply do not like selective desaturation, especially when it´s for no apparent reason, do not mean this to offend you but simply telling you why I did not vote this shot more than a 5.</td>', 'Sorry but I just simply do not like selective desaturation, especially when it´s for no apparent reason, do not mean this to offend you but simply telling you why I did not vote this shot more than a 5.', '2006-12-22 16:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142793, 440641, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lighting is the biggest problem with this shot, try to use an off camera lightsource next time when you try this, direct flash is never really flattering.  A good suggestion would be to use the light from a big window during an overcast day or some kind of artificial lighting that is like I said, off camera.</td>', 'Lighting is the biggest problem with this shot, try to use an off camera lightsource next time when you try this, direct flash is never really flattering.  A good suggestion would be to use the light from a big window during an overcast day or some kind of artificial lighting that is like I said, off camera.', '2006-12-22 16:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142795, 440316, 27482, '<td valign="top">Try using the full 640 pixles next time, I can promise you a better score if  you do.</td>', 'Try using the full 640 pixles next time, I can promise you a better score if  you do.', '2006-12-22 16:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
