(3142822, 440457, 27482, '<td valign="top">If I may make a suggestion, it would be to either include the feet of your subject next time or frame it more tightly, like around the waist so the cut off feet don´t look so accidental :)</td>', 'If I may make a suggestion, it would be to either include the feet of your subject next time or frame it more tightly, like around the waist so the cut off feet don´t look so accidental :)', '2006-12-22 16:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142824, 438284, 27482, '<td valign="top">I must admit I didn´t vote this very high, gave it a 5 and solely for not being aesthetically pleasing, the WB you chose leads to less pleasing skintones and same goes for lighting, this is just not my cup of tea, sorry.</td>', 'I must admit I didn´t vote this very high, gave it a 5 and solely for not being aesthetically pleasing, the WB you chose leads to less pleasing skintones and same goes for lighting, this is just not my cup of tea, sorry.', '2006-12-22 16:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142829, 439292, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I can´t put my finger on it, just this image isn´t aesthetically pleasing to me, the purple/pink skintones mostly combined with the color tones of the backround+frame along just aren´t my cup of tea, sorry but I voted this a 4 and thought you should at least know why.</td>', 'Sorry but I can´t put my finger on it, just this image isn´t aesthetically pleasing to me, the purple/pink skintones mostly combined with the color tones of the backround+frame along just aren´t my cup of tea, sorry but I voted this a 4 and thought you should at least know why.', '2006-12-22 16:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142831, 440644, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the post processing, needs something extra though for me to vote higher than 6.</td>', 'Nice job on the post processing, needs something extra though for me to vote higher than 6.', '2006-12-22 16:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142837, 440645, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I voted this a 3 and 99% of that is the poor image quality and fact that I don´t particularly care for abstract photographs.  Less grain, clearer photo and something to catch my eye (as it is it wanders all over the frame) would have lead to a higher score from me personally.</td>', 'Sorry but I voted this a 3 and 99% of that is the poor image quality and fact that I don´t particularly care for abstract photographs.  Less grain, clearer photo and something to catch my eye (as it is it wanders all over the frame) would have lead to a higher score from me personally.', '2006-12-22 17:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142856, 439838, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this seems a little "snapshottish" to me, could be better composed.  If I may make a friendly suggestion it would be to try shooting from a different angle next time, like going down to the ground and shooting upwards or the other way around, should lead to a more interesting result.</td>', 'Sorry but this seems a little "snapshottish" to me, could be better composed.  If I may make a friendly suggestion it would be to try shooting from a different angle next time, like going down to the ground and shooting upwards or the other way around, should lead to a more interesting result.', '2006-12-22 17:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142858, 440303, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, really dig the falling snow.  7 from me.</td>', 'Nice shot, really dig the falling snow.  7 from me.', '2006-12-22 17:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
