(3142863, 438190, 27482, '<td valign="top">A little too dark and grainy for my taste, I personally like clearer, crisper photographs but I do dig the flashlight pattern on the wall so that kindof evens it out, wish you could have both :)</td>', 'A little too dark and grainy for my taste, I personally like clearer, crisper photographs but I do dig the flashlight pattern on the wall so that kindof evens it out, wish you could have both :)', '2006-12-22 17:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142866, 438357, 62095, '<td valign="top">Quite creative, the crop is maybe a tad close.</td>', 'Quite creative, the crop is maybe a tad close.', '2006-12-22 17:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142871, 440590, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wanna know the first thing that popped into my head?  Mud looks to "organized", especially around the eyes and nothing on the shoulders?  Take a look at Kiwiness´s self portrait, the one where he put the mud on him and you should get what I mean.  Had you closed the eyes and put mud over then and opened and had it all over the shoulders too this would have been so much more visually compelling.  Not close to being a bad photo cause of it, just that is what can set a part a good photo from an excellent one :)  Like it, dig the lighting, think the WB is a bit too warm for my taste but good work.</td>', 'Wanna know the first thing that popped into my head?  Mud looks to "organized", especially around the eyes and nothing on the shoulders?  Take a look at Kiwiness´s self portrait, the one where he put the mud on him and you should get what I mean.  Had you closed the eyes and put mud over then and opened and had it all over the shoulders too this would have been so much more visually compelling.  Not close to being a bad photo cause of it, just that is what can set a part a good photo from an excellent one :)  Like it, dig the lighting, think the WB is a bit too warm for my taste but good work.', '2006-12-22 17:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142876, 440277, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I really would have liked this better if I had a face that I could connect to, I don´t really relate to this shot the way it´s presented but nice like I said, 6 from me.</td>', 'Nice, but I really would have liked this better if I had a face that I could connect to, I don´t really relate to this shot the way it´s presented but nice like I said, 6 from me.', '2006-12-22 17:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142886, 440471, 27482, '<td valign="top">I dig this shot, not dropping my jaw though but enough for a 7 from me and I am stingy on those :P</td>', 'I dig this shot, not dropping my jaw though but enough for a 7 from me and I am stingy on those :P', '2006-12-22 17:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3142894, 439246, 62095, '<td valign="top">Bigger Bigger Bigger.<br/> <br/>If only it were a bit bigger.</td>', 'Bigger Bigger Bigger. If only it were a bit bigger.', '2006-12-22 17:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
