(3142899, 438942, 62095, '<td valign="top">Great artistic shot</td>', 'Great artistic shot', '2006-12-22 17:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143198, 440599, 26001, '<td valign="top">i like the normal rockwell type post processing. now i am eager to learn how did you do it with basic editing. thanks in advance.</td>', 'i like the normal rockwell type post processing. now i am eager to learn how did you do it with basic editing. thanks in advance.', '2006-12-22 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143199, 439355, 53316, '<td valign="top">Aieee.  Contrast on this one is just great.  Makes the lips disappear, which looks really haunting.</td>', 'Aieee.  Contrast on this one is just great.  Makes the lips disappear, which looks really haunting.', '2006-12-22 19:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143200, 439835, 53316, '<td valign="top">Well gosh! I am glad I didn''t choose this title (was thinking of it) because I''d hate to be compared to this absolutely gorgeous shot.  I love the colors of the subject and the background, and I LOVE how the DOF is limited but in such a way that it is not excessive / does not draw attention to itself.  Also, I love how the material is arranged in an abstract way, but the shot itself does not seem abstract - it is a very cool juxtaposition.</td>', 'Well gosh! I am glad I didn''t choose this title (was thinking of it) because I''d hate to be compared to this absolutely gorgeous shot.  I love the colors of the subject and the background, and I LOVE how the DOF is limited but in such a way that it is not excessive / does not draw attention to itself.  Also, I love how the material is arranged in an abstract way, but the shot itself does not seem abstract - it is a very cool juxtaposition.', '2006-12-22 19:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143202, 440460, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the most beautiful shots I''ve seen in a while.</td>', 'I think this is one of the most beautiful shots I''ve seen in a while.', '2006-12-22 19:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143204, 440463, 53316, '<td valign="top">Love the processing.  Really emphasizes the lonely aspect as it seems "cold" where the person is, and they are looking outwards at a far off "warmness" of the someone they are missing.</td>', 'Love the processing.  Really emphasizes the lonely aspect as it seems "cold" where the person is, and they are looking outwards at a far off "warmness" of the someone they are missing.', '2006-12-22 19:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143206, 440037, 53316, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful image - the reflections are very lovely and work very well for "echoes".</td>', 'Such a beautiful image - the reflections are very lovely and work very well for "echoes".', '2006-12-22 19:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143217, 440288, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the concept very much but the composition is not so great for me - feels like I am missing a lot of what I should be seeing at the top.</td>', 'I like the concept very much but the composition is not so great for me - feels like I am missing a lot of what I should be seeing at the top.', '2006-12-22 19:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143219, 439838, 53316, '<td valign="top">This image lacks the "wow" factor of some of the other entries, but I do believe that it is a fitting image for the title that you chose.</td>', 'This image lacks the "wow" factor of some of the other entries, but I do believe that it is a fitting image for the title that you chose.', '2006-12-22 19:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143220, 439486, 53316, '<td valign="top">Too much empty space for me, but I love the colors.</td>', 'Too much empty space for me, but I love the colors.', '2006-12-22 19:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143222, 438357, 53316, '<td valign="top">I don''t care so much for the DOF here but I really like the "real" look to the words.</td>', 'I don''t care so much for the DOF here but I really like the "real" look to the words.', '2006-12-22 19:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143225, 440343, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an interesting shot! Very unique.</td>', 'Wow, what an interesting shot! Very unique.', '2006-12-22 19:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143226, 440184, 53316, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit oversharpened but maybe that''s just the light on the waves.  I like the shot.. colors are pleasing to my eye and there''s something about the lack of detail in the foreground that just makes me want to stare at the water forever.</td>', 'Seems a bit oversharpened but maybe that''s just the light on the waves.  I like the shot.. colors are pleasing to my eye and there''s something about the lack of detail in the foreground that just makes me want to stare at the water forever.', '2006-12-22 19:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143229, 440011, 53316, '<td valign="top">I really love the heart shaped dark spot next to the hand.  I think  maybe this suffered from compression?    Colors are great as well as composition.</td>', 'I really love the heart shaped dark spot next to the hand.  I think  maybe this suffered from compression?    Colors are great as well as composition.', '2006-12-22 19:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143230, 440058, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, how creative!! It''s good to see a shot with this title that doesn''t have a wall in it.  I like the composition and colors and everything really :-)</td>', 'Wow, how creative!! It''s good to see a shot with this title that doesn''t have a wall in it.  I like the composition and colors and everything really :-)', '2006-12-22 19:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143232, 440282, 53316, '<td valign="top">Background might have been better as a solid color. Focus and detail on the figures is great.</td>', 'Background might have been better as a solid color. Focus and detail on the figures is great.', '2006-12-22 20:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143234, 438560, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like the expression of the model.</td>', 'Wow, I really like the expression of the model.', '2006-12-22 20:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143235, 440196, 53316, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective - I like how the two streams of light look a bit different from each other because of that.</td>', 'Nice perspective - I like how the two streams of light look a bit different from each other because of that.', '2006-12-22 20:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143237, 440461, 53316, '<td valign="top">The shot''s a little busy for my tastes and the perspective is a tad off it seems, but overall I really like this! It is a very creative looking image.</td>', 'The shot''s a little busy for my tastes and the perspective is a tad off it seems, but overall I really like this! It is a very creative looking image.', '2006-12-22 20:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143239, 439538, 53316, '<td valign="top">A bit too much negative space for my tastes. I really like the choice of black and white here.</td>', 'A bit too much negative space for my tastes. I really like the choice of black and white here.', '2006-12-22 20:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
