(3143459, 440636, 31403, '<td valign="top">the water drops are my only suggestion on this wonderful image - with that dried up this is a superb image</td>', 'the water drops are my only suggestion on this wonderful image - with that dried up this is a superb image', '2006-12-22 22:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
