(3144334, 440470, 32641, '<td valign="top">I find the picture in the background a little to blury, and the partial sharpness of the leaf. Good composition and b/w conversion.</td>', 'I find the picture in the background a little to blury, and the partial sharpness of the leaf. Good composition and b/w conversion.', '2006-12-23 09:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
