(3144388, 440629, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very surreal looking.  I don''t know how you did that, but good job.</td>', 'Very surreal looking.  I don''t know how you did that, but good job.', '2006-12-23 10:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144390, 439355, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great shot. You really displayed this well.</td>', 'Great shot. You really displayed this well.', '2006-12-23 10:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144391, 439227, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like seeing the edges of the road in this.  It gives kind of a leading line feeling to it. Interesting use for a bowling ball.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like seeing the edges of the road in this.  It gives kind of a leading line feeling to it. Interesting use for a bowling ball.', '2006-12-23 11:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144392, 440604, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great idea.</td>', 'Great idea.', '2006-12-23 11:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144407, 439536, 24073, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing photo, a 9+ for a free study.  The thing is for me, is that this totally sidesteps the challenge.  Even if I could make sense of the title (and I can''t), it really doesn''t fit the mood of Pink Floyd.  Perhaps another good title for this would of been "do you think they''ll drop the bomb".  As I said though, you really have an amazing photo here no doubt about it.</td>', 'This is an amazing photo, a 9+ for a free study.  The thing is for me, is that this totally sidesteps the challenge.  Even if I could make sense of the title (and I can''t), it really doesn''t fit the mood of Pink Floyd.  Perhaps another good title for this would of been "do you think they''ll drop the bomb".  As I said though, you really have an amazing photo here no doubt about it.', '2006-12-23 11:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144481, 440629, 3214, '<td valign="top">So Floydian, and I just started to vote--will I find anything better?  The art from the Wall and the line from Wish You Were Here...works for me!</td>', 'So Floydian, and I just started to vote--will I find anything better?  The art from the Wall and the line from Wish You Were Here...works for me!', '2006-12-23 12:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144482, 439000, 3214, '<td valign="top">Clever concept! and execution.</td>', 'Clever concept! and execution.', '2006-12-23 12:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144483, 439672, 3214, '<td valign="top">This entry is going to flummox people that haven''t heard the song.  SO I''ll have to vote higher to compensate.  ;-)</td>', 'This entry is going to flummox people that haven''t heard the song.  SO I''ll have to vote higher to compensate.  ;-)', '2006-12-23 12:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144486, 440486, 9668, '<td valign="top">Well done, lovely image.</td>', 'Well done, lovely image.', '2006-12-23 12:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144487, 439322, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting editing. Made it look like a pop piece. well done.</td>', 'Interesting editing. Made it look like a pop piece. well done.', '2006-12-23 12:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144488, 440146, 9668, '<td valign="top">Like the blue duotone.</td>', 'Like the blue duotone.', '2006-12-23 12:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144489, 440463, 3214, '<td valign="top">Hoarfrost? and the sea''s texture adds interest, as do the surreal colors in keeping with the theme. I like the anonymity of your subject too.</td>', 'Hoarfrost? and the sea''s texture adds interest, as do the surreal colors in keeping with the theme. I like the anonymity of your subject too.', '2006-12-23 12:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144491, 440590, 9668, '<td valign="top">This is more of a nitpick, but why isn''t the rest of him muddy? Could you have shot it from an angle that wouldn show only his face? <br/>I like the composition though. I think the line from the shoulder leads nicely into the face. I wonder if you could have got any more light on his eyes? DPC really like eyes that are lit up. Overall, well done.</td>', 'This is more of a nitpick, but why isn''t the rest of him muddy? Could you have shot it from an angle that wouldn show only his face? I like the composition though. I think the line from the shoulder leads nicely into the face. I wonder if you could have got any more light on his eyes? DPC really like eyes that are lit up. Overall, well done.', '2006-12-23 12:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144494, 440457, 9668, '<td valign="top">Dog of War? Not sure about the sepia tone. Nice concept though.</td>', 'Dog of War? Not sure about the sepia tone. Nice concept though.', '2006-12-23 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144498, 440378, 9668, '<td valign="top">Like how you captured the song well.</td>', 'Like how you captured the song well.', '2006-12-23 12:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144503, 440563, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Love the amount of layers you have going on. The plant in the foreground, the lake and mountains in the middle ground, and the sky in the background. Nice job.</td>', 'Lovely image. Love the amount of layers you have going on. The plant in the foreground, the lake and mountains in the middle ground, and the sky in the background. Nice job.', '2006-12-23 12:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144505, 440352, 9668, '<td valign="top">This should do well. Iceland + Aurora borealis = Top Ten.</td>', 'This should do well. Iceland + Aurora borealis = Top Ten.', '2006-12-23 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
