(3144543, 440327, 26001, '<td valign="top">this is so cool. It would have been perfect (so giving you 9) if the platform you are standing is also parallel to the horizon. its a very minor nitpick though. btw i am eager to know how did you manage to get rid of (or hide) the strings attached to two balloons.</td>', 'this is so cool. It would have been perfect (so giving you 9) if the platform you are standing is also parallel to the horizon. its a very minor nitpick though. btw i am eager to know how did you manage to get rid of (or hide) the strings attached to two balloons.', '2006-12-23 12:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144546, 440632, 9668, '<td valign="top">This image just rocks! The silhouette, the shadows, the art on the wall. It is all working. My only nitpick would be to have the person more towards the center of the verticle beams. This may have been accomplished by stepping right a few steps, but I don''t know if you were able to or not. Still, this image is just awesome.</td>', 'This image just rocks! The silhouette, the shadows, the art on the wall. It is all working. My only nitpick would be to have the person more towards the center of the verticle beams. This may have been accomplished by stepping right a few steps, but I don''t know if you were able to or not. Still, this image is just awesome.', '2006-12-23 12:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144556, 440041, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awww.  I hope people understand the connection of image to title.  I think I do.  Very lonely seeming image.</td>', 'Awww.  I hope people understand the connection of image to title.  I think I do.  Very lonely seeming image.', '2006-12-23 12:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3144558, 440327, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I love this.  Concept is nice and it is executed well.</td>', 'Awesome! I love this.  Concept is nice and it is executed well.', '2006-12-23 12:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
