(3145595, 440144, 49374, '<td valign="top">scary</td>', 'scary', '2006-12-23 23:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145602, 440487, 31403, '<td valign="top">she''d be back again<br/>one sunny day<br/> <br/>Love this tune, what a great location to shoot it too - nice work</td>', 'she''d be back againone sunny day Love this tune, what a great location to shoot it too - nice work', '2006-12-23 23:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145641, 440290, 31403, '<td valign="top">white fluffy poodles with their tongues hanging out are NOT what pink floyd was referring to!  :-)  no point deducted for interpretation<br/> <br/>the cut off legs are troublesome to me - and the glowy eye.</td>', 'white fluffy poodles with their tongues hanging out are NOT what pink floyd was referring to!  :-)  no point deducted for interpretation the cut off legs are troublesome to me - and the glowy eye.', '2006-12-24 00:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145642, 440544, 53316, '<td valign="top">Closed eyes make this great. I like the choice of black and white as well as the contrast.</td>', 'Closed eyes make this great. I like the choice of black and white as well as the contrast.', '2006-12-24 00:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145643, 440595, 53316, '<td valign="top">This is a decent abstract shot - composition is good especially - but I would have prefered to have the colors or levels or curves or whatever adjusted some so that the bulb was brighter.</td>', 'This is a decent abstract shot - composition is good especially - but I would have prefered to have the colors or levels or curves or whatever adjusted some so that the bulb was brighter.', '2006-12-24 00:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145645, 440251, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very interesting mood.  I am not sure I like the green tone to this, but I like the overall darkness and the lack of focus.  It seems very "this is a thought" versus "this is an object I''m photographing" - which might lower your score some in the end maybe, but does work very, very well with this title.</td>', 'Very interesting mood.  I am not sure I like the green tone to this, but I like the overall darkness and the lack of focus.  It seems very "this is a thought" versus "this is an object I''m photographing" - which might lower your score some in the end maybe, but does work very, very well with this title.', '2006-12-24 00:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145647, 439322, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great background!!</td>', 'Great background!!', '2006-12-24 00:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145651, 439503, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great clarity in the portions with sky - very nice.  I like the reflection of the wall as well.</td>', 'Great clarity in the portions with sky - very nice.  I like the reflection of the wall as well.', '2006-12-24 00:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145652, 440456, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very "real" portrait - I like it!</td>', 'Very "real" portrait - I like it!', '2006-12-24 00:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145653, 440457, 53316, '<td valign="top">Seems like this could use a levels or curves adjustment.  What I mean is that the tones seem off to me.  I also would have prefered a looser crop at the bottom.  I like the pose of the dog and the way the guns are arranged behind the dog.</td>', 'Seems like this could use a levels or curves adjustment.  What I mean is that the tones seem off to me.  I also would have prefered a looser crop at the bottom.  I like the pose of the dog and the way the guns are arranged behind the dog.', '2006-12-24 00:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145654, 440642, 53316, '<td valign="top">I do not care for the limited DOF here.  I like the colors and the subtle border however.</td>', 'I do not care for the limited DOF here.  I like the colors and the subtle border however.', '2006-12-24 00:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145655, 439203, 53316, '<td valign="top">This is a sad sort of photo... I wish that people wouldn''t have to miss their family.  I think technically the lighting / contrast could be improved as well as the color balance.  I do like the composition - it''s a bit unusual but I think it works as it seems the child is reaching upwards for a father figure that cannot be obtained.  I also really love the message "sweet home" on the clothing as it fits very well with the theme of the photo.</td>', 'This is a sad sort of photo... I wish that people wouldn''t have to miss their family.  I think technically the lighting / contrast could be improved as well as the color balance.  I do like the composition - it''s a bit unusual but I think it works as it seems the child is reaching upwards for a father figure that cannot be obtained.  I also really love the message "sweet home" on the clothing as it fits very well with the theme of the photo.', '2006-12-24 00:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145656, 439844, 53316, '<td valign="top">Like the interesting processing here.</td>', 'Like the interesting processing here.', '2006-12-24 00:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145657, 439737, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great selective desat.</td>', 'Great selective desat.', '2006-12-24 00:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145658, 440614, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very, very interesting effect here! I really like it. It''s keeping me guessing as to how you did this as well as being visually pleasing.  I do wonder though if maybe all of the fingers of the front hand could have been inside the ones in the background (I mean I like on two of the fingers how there is blue surrounding both sides, and I wish it was like this throughout) but that''s sort of a nitpick.</td>', 'Very, very interesting effect here! I really like it. It''s keeping me guessing as to how you did this as well as being visually pleasing.  I do wonder though if maybe all of the fingers of the front hand could have been inside the ones in the background (I mean I like on two of the fingers how there is blue surrounding both sides, and I wish it was like this throughout) but that''s sort of a nitpick.', '2006-12-24 00:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145660, 440590, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think the skin showing around the eyes throws this off for me a bit.  I do like the composition a lot.</td>', 'I think the skin showing around the eyes throws this off for me a bit.  I do like the composition a lot.', '2006-12-24 00:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145661, 440280, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and fun shot to look at! Neat perspective as well.</td>', 'Very colorful and fun shot to look at! Neat perspective as well.', '2006-12-24 00:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145662, 440026, 53316, '<td valign="top">Seems like a bit of haloing around the leaves but otherwise fantastic.  I don''t care too much for the border though - perhaps a more subtle shade would have been better.  Composition and bokeh are lovely.</td>', 'Seems like a bit of haloing around the leaves but otherwise fantastic.  I don''t care too much for the border though - perhaps a more subtle shade would have been better.  Composition and bokeh are lovely.', '2006-12-24 00:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145664, 439410, 53316, '<td valign="top">Lovely abstract.</td>', 'Lovely abstract.', '2006-12-24 00:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145665, 440147, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh. Scary.  The perspective and deranged look to the model make me feel like I just got knocked down on the floor and he''s standing over me.  Really, really effective perspective.</td>', 'Oh my gosh. Scary.  The perspective and deranged look to the model make me feel like I just got knocked down on the floor and he''s standing over me.  Really, really effective perspective.', '2006-12-24 00:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145666, 438942, 53316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.. looks like a painting. Very peaceful to look at.</td>', 'Beautiful.. looks like a painting. Very peaceful to look at.', '2006-12-24 00:32:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3145667, 439039, 53316, '<td valign="top">Is that supposed to look like a guy''s face on the brick at the top? I like it.</td>', 'Is that supposed to look like a guy''s face on the brick at the top? I like it.', '2006-12-24 00:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145671, 439772, 53316, '<td valign="top">Lovely muted colors and wonderful way of showing an absence of blue.</td>', 'Lovely muted colors and wonderful way of showing an absence of blue.', '2006-12-24 00:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145673, 440530, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and colors - this is a very pretty image. It does not make sense to me why someone would look so sad at Chrismas lights though. Maybe because they are tangled?  Hm okay, I will go with that. :-)  I think my favorite part of this photo is the spots of color on the background... that''s really nifty.</td>', 'I love the lighting and colors - this is a very pretty image. It does not make sense to me why someone would look so sad at Chrismas lights though. Maybe because they are tangled?  Hm okay, I will go with that. :-)  I think my favorite part of this photo is the spots of color on the background... that''s really nifty.', '2006-12-24 00:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145675, 440383, 53316, '<td valign="top">It''s a gorgeous photo, but I personally think it would have been better in a free study.</td>', 'It''s a gorgeous photo, but I personally think it would have been better in a free study.', '2006-12-24 00:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145676, 440378, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think I''d prefer more contrast but in a way it seems to fit the mood of the title as-is.</td>', 'I think I''d prefer more contrast but in a way it seems to fit the mood of the title as-is.', '2006-12-24 00:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145678, 440336, 53316, '<td valign="top">Hm. Not sure I understand this shot so much.  But it is a lovely abstract.  Very Christmas-ey.</td>', 'Hm. Not sure I understand this shot so much.  But it is a lovely abstract.  Very Christmas-ey.', '2006-12-24 00:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145679, 440644, 53316, '<td valign="top">Heh. Great image to fit the lyrics.  I love that there''s a hole there... it just really works.</td>', 'Heh. Great image to fit the lyrics.  I love that there''s a hole there... it just really works.', '2006-12-24 00:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145681, 440632, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting.</td>', 'Great composition and lighting.', '2006-12-24 00:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145682, 440515, 53316, '<td valign="top">It maybe would have been better to rotate the shot a bit so it''s straight? But good contrast and lighting.</td>', 'It maybe would have been better to rotate the shot a bit so it''s straight? But good contrast and lighting.', '2006-12-24 00:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145683, 440610, 53316, '<td valign="top">Um... wow. I can''t say I like the subject matter personally but you did this very well technically! Composition.. lighting.. detail - all really fit with the "moon-up-in-the-sky" idea. Great job.</td>', 'Um... wow. I can''t say I like the subject matter personally but you did this very well technically! Composition.. lighting.. detail - all really fit with the "moon-up-in-the-sky" idea. Great job.', '2006-12-24 00:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145685, 440183, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oooh, interesting concept!</td>', 'Oooh, interesting concept!', '2006-12-24 00:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145686, 440662, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the processing for what it is, just doesn''t seem "warm" enough to go with the image of flames. But if I were voting I would not vote down for that because the image itself works nicely, and isn''t specifically *not* flame.</td>', 'I like the processing for what it is, just doesn''t seem "warm" enough to go with the image of flames. But if I were voting I would not vote down for that because the image itself works nicely, and isn''t specifically *not* flame.', '2006-12-24 00:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145700, 440487, 53316, '<td valign="top">Creepy! Very effective emotionally.</td>', 'Creepy! Very effective emotionally.', '2006-12-24 00:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145702, 439890, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the detail in the center.. I just wish that it extended throughout the whole shot, because I want to see more of its awesomeness.</td>', 'I like the detail in the center.. I just wish that it extended throughout the whole shot, because I want to see more of its awesomeness.', '2006-12-24 00:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145703, 439821, 53316, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot.  I like the detail.</td>', 'Nice macro shot.  I like the detail.', '2006-12-24 00:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145704, 440252, 53316, '<td valign="top">A nice shot technically, it just doesn''t grab me.</td>', 'A nice shot technically, it just doesn''t grab me.', '2006-12-24 00:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145705, 440650, 53316, '<td valign="top">Hm. I feel like I could stare at this for an hour.  Very interesting.</td>', 'Hm. I feel like I could stare at this for an hour.  Very interesting.', '2006-12-24 00:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145710, 439737, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your choice of selective desat in this shot is kinda confusing to the eye.  I don''t understand why...<br/>TC</td>', 'Your choice of selective desat in this shot is kinda confusing to the eye.  I don''t understand why...TC', '2006-12-24 00:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145711, 440480, 53316, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  I think this captures the idea of astronomy in a beautiful and abstract way.</td>', 'Lovely.  I think this captures the idea of astronomy in a beautiful and abstract way.', '2006-12-24 00:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145714, 439847, 53316, '<td valign="top">Love the concept. It really exemplifies what the ahh-i-have-a-problem! brain feels like sometimes.</td>', 'Love the concept. It really exemplifies what the ahh-i-have-a-problem! brain feels like sometimes.', '2006-12-24 00:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145716, 440463, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like the overall feeling of this scene.  The overly processed colors (which I normally don''t like) actually work well here.  Wish the boy were sharper (looks like you oversharpened a touch trying to get him so) but it''s only a minor distraction from the total work.  Nice shot for the theme!<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, I really like the overall feeling of this scene.  The overly processed colors (which I normally don''t like) actually work well here.  Wish the boy were sharper (looks like you oversharpened a touch trying to get him so) but it''s only a minor distraction from the total work.  Nice shot for the theme!TC', '2006-12-24 00:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145719, 440595, 9906, '<td valign="top">I believe the correct line is ''you crazy diamond''...<br/>TC</td>', 'I believe the correct line is ''you crazy diamond''...TC', '2006-12-24 01:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145721, 440644, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice inspite of the title!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice inspite of the title!TC', '2006-12-24 01:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145723, 439310, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is very cool and carries much of the feeling of the song and album!<br/>TC</td>', 'This is very cool and carries much of the feeling of the song and album!TC', '2006-12-24 01:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145727, 439039, 9906, '<td valign="top">Of all the wall photo''s I''ve seen so far in this challenge, this one most matches the feeling of the movie.  This is probably because the wall resembles the one in the end of the movie so much.  Don''t know if this is such a good thing though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Of all the wall photo''s I''ve seen so far in this challenge, this one most matches the feeling of the movie.  This is probably because the wall resembles the one in the end of the movie so much.  Don''t know if this is such a good thing though...TC', '2006-12-24 01:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145733, 439355, 9906, '<td valign="top">The first thing that caught my eye was the border then I noticed there was an image inside it.  This image fits the challenge nicely but it''s power is reduced by the overwhelming nature of that which surrounds it.<br/>TC<br/>PS:  Your white inline is lopsided...</td>', 'The first thing that caught my eye was the border then I noticed there was an image inside it.  This image fits the challenge nicely but it''s power is reduced by the overwhelming nature of that which surrounds it.TCPS:  Your white inline is lopsided...', '2006-12-24 01:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145734, 440539, 9906, '<td valign="top">The line from the song would have been a perfectly adequate title!<br/>TC</td>', 'The line from the song would have been a perfectly adequate title!TC', '2006-12-24 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145735, 439539, 9906, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I look at this and do not see Pink Floyd, rather The Who''s Quadrophenia...<br/>TC</td>', 'For some reason, I look at this and do not see Pink Floyd, rather The Who''s Quadrophenia...TC', '2006-12-24 01:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145747, 438726, 9906, '<td valign="top">This violates MY literal artwork clause...<br/>TC</td>', 'This violates MY literal artwork clause...TC', '2006-12-24 01:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3145815, 439783, 69050, '<td valign="top">Edit: got the explination of the green bee, seems legit. Very intersting indeed,  upping my vote. 7</td>', 'Edit: got the explination of the green bee, seems legit. Very intersting indeed,  upping my vote. 7', '2006-12-24 02:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
