(3147636, 440336, 61818, '<td valign="top">I like abstracts, I really do.  I''m also painfully aware of the low scres they get on DPC, so I really try and see the positives in them when the rare abstract shows up in a challenge.  That said, I can''t for the life of me tell what this has to do with Money, the song Money, greed, anything. <br/> <br/> <br/>Sorry.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like abstracts, I really do.  I''m also painfully aware of the low scres they get on DPC, so I really try and see the positives in them when the rare abstract shows up in a challenge.  That said, I can''t for the life of me tell what this has to do with Money, the song Money, greed, anything.   Sorry.  Good luck.', '2006-12-25 11:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3147640, 440327, 61818, '<td valign="top">Awesome, another shot that looks like it could be a floyd album cover.  A bit literal of an interpretation, but the cpomosition, the tones, the isolated feel - you really nailed it.  Great shot.<br/> <br/>- Coming back to bump.  This is really nice work.</td>', 'Awesome, another shot that looks like it could be a floyd album cover.  A bit literal of an interpretation, but the cpomosition, the tones, the isolated feel - you really nailed it.  Great shot. - Coming back to bump.  This is really nice work.', '2006-12-25 11:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3147641, 440184, 68197, '<td valign="top">Never would have known this was a Pink Floyd story photo; looks like just a nice beah view. The song is a first person voice talking about first person experience, not a Conde naste travelogue.</td>', 'Never would have known this was a Pink Floyd story photo; looks like just a nice beah view. The song is a first person voice talking about first person experience, not a Conde naste travelogue.', '2006-12-25 11:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3147642, 439539, 61818, '<td valign="top">I love this.  I don''t quite see the connection to the theme of the wall, especially since there are two people walking next to each other and the Wall was about hiding within yourself from everyone else.  But that''s my interpretation.<br/> <br/>Love the PP here, love the composition.  The way the wall dominates the scene and minimizes the people is great.<br/> <br/>Good job.  Interested to see how this fares.  Bumping it up.</td>', 'I love this.  I don''t quite see the connection to the theme of the wall, especially since there are two people walking next to each other and the Wall was about hiding within yourself from everyone else.  But that''s my interpretation. Love the PP here, love the composition.  The way the wall dominates the scene and minimizes the people is great. Good job.  Interested to see how this fares.  Bumping it up.', '2006-12-25 11:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3147644, 438560, 68197, '<td valign="top">Technically good; emotionally not convincing.</td>', 'Technically good; emotionally not convincing.', '2006-12-25 11:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3147733, 438942, 59276, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful picture</td>', 'what a beautiful picture', '2006-12-25 12:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3147746, 440522, 66597, '<td valign="top">A couple of minor things would help this photo tremendously IMO, and can be done with Photoshop. First, straighten horizon. Second, up the saturation a bit - it looks washed out. Finally, I''d recommend dodging the front of the building so it pops more.</td>', 'A couple of minor things would help this photo tremendously IMO, and can be done with Photoshop. First, straighten horizon. Second, up the saturation a bit - it looks washed out. Finally, I''d recommend dodging the front of the building so it pops more.', '2006-12-25 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
