(3147753, 439852, 66597, '<td valign="top">Although this photo technically is fine, I''m not drawn in. It may because there''s no real focal point, or possibly because of the even number of cloth bolts. There may also be too many patterns - I''m wondering how it would look with one solid bolt of color between the left two. Just my .02.</td>', 'Although this photo technically is fine, I''m not drawn in. It may because there''s no real focal point, or possibly because of the even number of cloth bolts. There may also be too many patterns - I''m wondering how it would look with one solid bolt of color between the left two. Just my .02.', '2006-12-25 13:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
