(3148745, 440486, 30049, '<td valign="top">Best of the "Hey you..." photo''s in this challenge IMO.  Very nice job in the composition in placing your subject within the frame.  Also like the way you restrained yourself from cropping this to try and "fill the frame" with the primary subject.  The space around the man (feeling of emptiness, coldness, large void) is what helps make this image work.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Best of the "Hey you..." photo''s in this challenge IMO.  Very nice job in the composition in placing your subject within the frame.  Also like the way you restrained yourself from cropping this to try and "fill the frame" with the primary subject.  The space around the man (feeling of emptiness, coldness, large void) is what helps make this image work.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-25 22:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3148748, 440648, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and DOF.  Only thing I''m not sure of is your choice for a blue interior border.  Minor, I know.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and DOF.  Only thing I''m not sure of is your choice for a blue interior border.  Minor, I know.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-25 22:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
