(3149964, 440463, 27373, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  There is a sense of lonliness and loss about it.  There is a little motion blurring around the person.  I am guessing this was probably about a 1/2 second exposure or a little longer.</td>', 'I like this shot.  There is a sense of lonliness and loss about it.  There is a little motion blurring around the person.  I am guessing this was probably about a 1/2 second exposure or a little longer.', '2006-12-26 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
