(3150037, 440662, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I don´t really care for the "look" on this picture, the blue hue and harsh shadows along with the strong noise so I gave it a 4.</td>', 'Sorry but I don´t really care for the "look" on this picture, the blue hue and harsh shadows along with the strong noise so I gave it a 4.', '2006-12-26 16:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150039, 440565, 27482, '<td valign="top">Think this image would benefit from having less noise so if you were bumping up the ISO to get the right exposure, I would bump it back down and use a tripod and longer shutterspeed since you are shooting a static subject.</td>', 'Think this image would benefit from having less noise so if you were bumping up the ISO to get the right exposure, I would bump it back down and use a tripod and longer shutterspeed since you are shooting a static subject.', '2006-12-26 16:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150066, 440336, 70270, '<td valign="top">fuzzy, don''t get it</td>', 'fuzzy, don''t get it', '2006-12-26 17:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150100, 440037, 30049, '<td valign="top">I have no idea if this fits Pink Floyd or not, but the photo and title is a wonderful combination.  Great job to see this image and better still in capturing it correctly.  Well done!</td>', 'I have no idea if this fits Pink Floyd or not, but the photo and title is a wonderful combination.  Great job to see this image and better still in capturing it correctly.  Well done!', '2006-12-26 17:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150112, 440399, 27482, '<td valign="top">I almost like the composition, the black right half is not really doing it for me and I think I would have liked the comp. better if you had taken a step or two to the left.  Dig the b/w conversion but could stand to be a bit brighter for my taste. 6 from me.</td>', 'I almost like the composition, the black right half is not really doing it for me and I think I would have liked the comp. better if you had taken a step or two to the left.  Dig the b/w conversion but could stand to be a bit brighter for my taste. 6 from me.', '2006-12-26 17:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150114, 440250, 30049, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how this stacks up with Pink Floyd, but this photo is very captivating.  As a viewer I''m drawn in and need to look around a while to figure out what else may lay hidden within.  Only minor complaint from me is that I wish the eye was sharper.  Overall, very well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I have no idea how this stacks up with Pink Floyd, but this photo is very captivating.  As a viewer I''m drawn in and need to look around a while to figure out what else may lay hidden within.  Only minor complaint from me is that I wish the eye was sharper.  Overall, very well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-26 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150117, 440460, 27482, '<td valign="top">This would have scored a full point or even two better had the focus been on the eye and not the nose but I still dig this image, think I would have gone for a "squareish" crop on this one and taken out quite a bit of the right side, almost to the eye.  6 from me.</td>', 'This would have scored a full point or even two better had the focus been on the eye and not the nose but I still dig this image, think I would have gone for a "squareish" crop on this one and taken out quite a bit of the right side, almost to the eye.  6 from me.', '2006-12-26 17:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150118, 439501, 30049, '<td valign="top">One of the better firewood and flames shots I''ve seen.  Great detail and very nice control on exposure with the flames.  Well done.</td>', 'One of the better firewood and flames shots I''ve seen.  Great detail and very nice control on exposure with the flames.  Well done.', '2006-12-26 17:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150129, 440530, 27482, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, think if you had included just a little bit of more lighting on the girl this would have worked so much better for me.  Still good and got a 6 from me.</td>', 'Like the idea, think if you had included just a little bit of more lighting on the girl this would have worked so much better for me.  Still good and got a 6 from me.', '2006-12-26 17:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150137, 440595, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I voted this a 3, It´s too flat contrast wise and uninteresting to appeal to me, just thought you should know why I votet so low.</td>', 'Sorry but I voted this a 3, It´s too flat contrast wise and uninteresting to appeal to me, just thought you should know why I votet so low.', '2006-12-26 17:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150140, 440477, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling I would have liked this better in color, also I don´t find thie vantage point of the bird the best, I would have preferred to be looking it straight on and not be ogling it´s butt :)</td>', 'I have a feeling I would have liked this better in color, also I don´t find thie vantage point of the bird the best, I would have preferred to be looking it straight on and not be ogling it´s butt :)', '2006-12-26 17:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150148, 440040, 27482, '<td valign="top">I gotta say I dislike those brances in the lower right corner, at least the fact that they are out of focus, they really do nothing for me other than pull my attention away from the moon.</td>', 'I gotta say I dislike those brances in the lower right corner, at least the fact that they are out of focus, they really do nothing for me other than pull my attention away from the moon.', '2006-12-26 17:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150159, 439567, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is an extraordinary photo. Getting the details to show with those star trails is amazing. 10.</td>', 'This is an extraordinary photo. Getting the details to show with those star trails is amazing. 10.', '2006-12-26 17:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150160, 440568, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the black band on the left. It looks like a CD cover. This is so far my favorite of challenge. Extra zany, a bit scary, highly worthy of a PF cover. 10. Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'I love the black band on the left. It looks like a CD cover. This is so far my favorite of challenge. Extra zany, a bit scary, highly worthy of a PF cover. 10. Hope it ribbons.', '2006-12-26 17:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150162, 440654, 66597, '<td valign="top">One of most creative entries in this challenge. I''ve always found The Dogs of War to be edgy, almost scary, and these hammers sum up the feeling very well. The lighting is superb, by the way, and sharp as a tack. 9.</td>', 'One of most creative entries in this challenge. I''ve always found The Dogs of War to be edgy, almost scary, and these hammers sum up the feeling very well. The lighting is superb, by the way, and sharp as a tack. 9.', '2006-12-26 17:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150163, 440487, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is spooky. Great scene, and figure in gas mask adds, though I''d like to see him a bit more clearly. This one ranks high on the creativity scale and excellent composition. 9.</td>', 'Wow, this is spooky. Great scene, and figure in gas mask adds, though I''d like to see him a bit more clearly. This one ranks high on the creativity scale and excellent composition. 9.', '2006-12-26 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150164, 439539, 66597, '<td valign="top">Best "wall" photo I''ve seen yet in this challenge. Excellent placement of the two figures. This one also works outside of PF challenge. Highly emotional. 9.</td>', 'Best "wall" photo I''ve seen yet in this challenge. Excellent placement of the two figures. This one also works outside of PF challenge. Highly emotional. 9.', '2006-12-26 17:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150165, 439254, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great creativity, made me LOL. Hope you''ll post how you did this in basic. 9.</td>', 'Great shot, great creativity, made me LOL. Hope you''ll post how you did this in basic. 9.', '2006-12-26 17:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150166, 438726, 66597, '<td valign="top">This really has the look and feel of a PF album cover. The piece of sky in the top left adds tremendously to the composition and makes it feel like your own creation instead of just a photo of someone else''s art. 9.</td>', 'This really has the look and feel of a PF album cover. The piece of sky in the top left adds tremendously to the composition and makes it feel like your own creation instead of just a photo of someone else''s art. 9.', '2006-12-26 17:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150172, 440327, 66597, '<td valign="top">Hope you''ll post a tutorial on how you pulled this off in basic, but I see it''s been validated, so obviously you did! Great job. Silhouette is striking. 9.</td>', 'Hope you''ll post a tutorial on how you pulled this off in basic, but I see it''s been validated, so obviously you did! Great job. Silhouette is striking. 9.', '2006-12-26 17:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150173, 440460, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo that would work just as well outside of this challenge. The droplets of water add that certain something. 9.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo that would work just as well outside of this challenge. The droplets of water add that certain something. 9.', '2006-12-26 17:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150174, 440375, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, and I love the greens, purples, and small dock in the bottom with stars. A tad more space at the top might not hurt, but just a personal preference. 9.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, and I love the greens, purples, and small dock in the bottom with stars. A tad more space at the top might not hurt, but just a personal preference. 9.', '2006-12-26 17:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150177, 440530, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and highly creative. I''d be interested to see this in b&amp;w outside of this challenge. 9.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and highly creative. I''d be interested to see this in b&w outside of this challenge. 9.', '2006-12-26 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150178, 439254, 27482, '<td valign="top">I kindof like this shot, very cool lighting but a bit too busy with all those ducks overlaying like that, my eye really doesn´t find a one spot to rest on.  That said though, one of the best in the challenge and an 8 from me, hope you do well with it.</td>', 'I kindof like this shot, very cool lighting but a bit too busy with all those ducks overlaying like that, my eye really doesn´t find a one spot to rest on.  That said though, one of the best in the challenge and an 8 from me, hope you do well with it.', '2006-12-26 17:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150180, 439355, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is unbelievably spooky. Can truly see it as a PF album cover. Highly emotive in a terrifying way, and good exposure. 9.</td>', 'This is unbelievably spooky. Can truly see it as a PF album cover. Highly emotive in a terrifying way, and good exposure. 9.', '2006-12-26 17:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150181, 439227, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a great entry. The composition works very well, and it has a true Pink Floyd feel. The only thing that bothers me a bit is the lightness of the road toward the top of photo- it draws the eye away from the subject. 8.</td>', 'This is a great entry. The composition works very well, and it has a true Pink Floyd feel. The only thing that bothers me a bit is the lightness of the road toward the top of photo- it draws the eye away from the subject. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150183, 439292, 66597, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and strong composition. 8.</td>', 'Interesting lighting and strong composition. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150186, 440590, 66597, '<td valign="top">Excellent entry. Obviously took a lot of preparation! This really says "Pink Floyd" to me, right down to the crazy eyeballs and serious expression. It would be really creepy if the face was just floating in black, but realize that wouldn''t be allowed in challenge. Just a thought. 8.</td>', 'Excellent entry. Obviously took a lot of preparation! This really says "Pink Floyd" to me, right down to the crazy eyeballs and serious expression. It would be really creepy if the face was just floating in black, but realize that wouldn''t be allowed in challenge. Just a thought. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150187, 440649, 66597, '<td valign="top">DOF is very well executed in this photo, and face is perfectly lit.  Something feels a trifle off balance - it may be the close crop on right arm. Whites also look just a tad blown on dress. Overall, very strong entry that would work outside this challenge as well. 8.</td>', 'DOF is very well executed in this photo, and face is perfectly lit.  Something feels a trifle off balance - it may be the close crop on right arm. Whites also look just a tad blown on dress. Overall, very strong entry that would work outside this challenge as well. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150188, 440648, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very strong image, and excellent use of centering instead of "rule of thirds." I''m trying to decide if the light splotch on the far left is a detriment - I think it is - but only a minor one. 8.</td>', 'Very strong image, and excellent use of centering instead of "rule of thirds." I''m trying to decide if the light splotch on the far left is a detriment - I think it is - but only a minor one. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150190, 440636, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is creative and cool. I like the area where the two dyes seem to melt into one. I also like the continuity of the sky running through the whole photo. Great job. 8.</td>', 'This is creative and cool. I like the area where the two dyes seem to melt into one. I also like the continuity of the sky running through the whole photo. Great job. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150191, 440544, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo that would work outside of this challenge as well. Emotive is very well captured. 8.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo that would work outside of this challenge as well. Emotive is very well captured. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150193, 440245, 66597, '<td valign="top">Simple and lovely. The posture of the silhouette adds movement to an otherwise static image. 8.</td>', 'Simple and lovely. The posture of the silhouette adds movement to an otherwise static image. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150194, 440282, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is really cool - looks like it could be an actual album cover. I might like to see just a bit more breathing room - so to speak - on either side of the mummies, but just a personal prefernce. Very strong entry. 8.</td>', 'This is really cool - looks like it could be an actual album cover. I might like to see just a bit more breathing room - so to speak - on either side of the mummies, but just a personal prefernce. Very strong entry. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150195, 440436, 47754, '<td valign="top">GREAT!!!</td>', 'GREAT!!!', '2006-12-26 17:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150207, 439536, 66597, '<td valign="top">Although a DC image does not say "Pink Floyd" to me, you still managed to capture the feel of PF via the unreal pinky-orange sky and buildings that look almost eerily flat. A most interesting entry. 8.</td>', 'Although a DC image does not say "Pink Floyd" to me, you still managed to capture the feel of PF via the unreal pinky-orange sky and buildings that look almost eerily flat. A most interesting entry. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150208, 440629, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is extra creepy, but well done. Hope you''ll post a tutorial on this one, because I can''t imagine how you pulled it off in basic. Worthy of a PF album cover, though would like just a bit stronger composition with more breathing room below the bottom "soul." 8.</td>', 'This is extra creepy, but well done. Hope you''ll post a tutorial on this one, because I can''t imagine how you pulled it off in basic. Worthy of a PF album cover, though would like just a bit stronger composition with more breathing room below the bottom "soul." 8.', '2006-12-26 17:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150210, 440026, 66597, '<td valign="top">The frost on the leaves is crisp and beautiful. This is one of those photos that made me say "wow" when I opened it. I do wish the background were a bit more blurred, but not a major detraction. 8.</td>', 'The frost on the leaves is crisp and beautiful. This is one of those photos that made me say "wow" when I opened it. I do wish the background were a bit more blurred, but not a major detraction. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150213, 440343, 66597, '<td valign="top">Exceedingly creative and spooky without going overboard. Would be interesting to see this photo with a less saturated and prominent sky. 8.</td>', 'Exceedingly creative and spooky without going overboard. Would be interesting to see this photo with a less saturated and prominent sky. 8.', '2006-12-26 17:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150215, 439847, 66597, '<td valign="top">An interesting interpretation. Nice composition with the lights. Am having trouble being "drawn into" the photo, though. 7.</td>', 'An interesting interpretation. Nice composition with the lights. Am having trouble being "drawn into" the photo, though. 7.', '2006-12-26 17:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150216, 439211, 66597, '<td valign="top">Creative. Looks like a flying saucer. I really like the water droplets. Something about the composition doesn''t quite work for me - would like to see slightly more tilt to the plate and a little more black space around edges. Still, very strong entry. 7.</td>', 'Creative. Looks like a flying saucer. I really like the water droplets. Something about the composition doesn''t quite work for me - would like to see slightly more tilt to the plate and a little more black space around edges. Still, very strong entry. 7.', '2006-12-26 17:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150218, 440383, 66597, '<td valign="top">The composition works, nice silhouette, good lighting. It doesn''t wow me, but it is a solid photo. 7.</td>', 'The composition works, nice silhouette, good lighting. It doesn''t wow me, but it is a solid photo. 7.', '2006-12-26 17:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150220, 439835, 66597, '<td valign="top">Creative and nice composition with the scarves and planet. I would like to see a little more of the alien''s? face peeking out - it took me a minute to find it in the scarves. 7.</td>', 'Creative and nice composition with the scarves and planet. I would like to see a little more of the alien''s? face peeking out - it took me a minute to find it in the scarves. 7.', '2006-12-26 17:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150221, 439538, 66597, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be an album cover - I''m picturing an artsy font to the right. I''m not sure it would have too much appeal outside this challenge, but a strong entry nonetheless. 7.</td>', 'This looks like it could be an album cover - I''m picturing an artsy font to the right. I''m not sure it would have too much appeal outside this challenge, but a strong entry nonetheless. 7.', '2006-12-26 17:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150222, 439503, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective on the wall - great lines, and the stars enhance the photo. This is one that definitely would have appeal outide of PF challenge as well. The only distracting elements are the bright light at photo''s edge and  slightly OOF bricks in foreground. 7.</td>', 'I really like the perspective on the wall - great lines, and the stars enhance the photo. This is one that definitely would have appeal outide of PF challenge as well. The only distracting elements are the bright light at photo''s edge and  slightly OOF bricks in foreground. 7.', '2006-12-26 17:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150223, 440609, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice sports shot but I really can´t see how this relates to the challenge if you would strip this photo of it´s title so I deducted a point for that.  Dig the slight motion and out of focus player in the back but dislike the placement of the judge, he is so dominant in the composition he just draws my eye away from the player in focus.</td>', 'Nice sports shot but I really can´t see how this relates to the challenge if you would strip this photo of it´s title so I deducted a point for that.  Dig the slight motion and out of focus player in the back but dislike the placement of the judge, he is so dominant in the composition he just draws my eye away from the player in focus.', '2006-12-26 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150225, 439915, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and colors. The one streetlight has a great PF feel. This would also be very interesting with a small aperture (i.e. f/22) to produce star effect on the streetlight. 7</td>', 'Very nice composition and colors. The one streetlight has a great PF feel. This would also be very interesting with a small aperture (i.e. f/22) to produce star effect on the streetlight. 7', '2006-12-26 17:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150226, 440645, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. It is very Pink Floyd. Looks like you really upped the contrast and/or saturation, but IMO it works here. 7.</td>', 'I like this a lot. It is very Pink Floyd. Looks like you really upped the contrast and/or saturation, but IMO it works here. 7.', '2006-12-26 17:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150227, 440251, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is stylish and interesting. However, there isn''t quite enough detail in the face to truly draw me in, and it looks a bit too pixelated. Nonetheless, I applaud your creativity and you have created an image that is oddly compelling. 7.</td>', 'This is stylish and interesting. However, there isn''t quite enough detail in the face to truly draw me in, and it looks a bit too pixelated. Nonetheless, I applaud your creativity and you have created an image that is oddly compelling. 7.', '2006-12-26 17:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150230, 440366, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this would have been a nice shot but the image quality is pretty poor, it would have needed to be clearer, more contrasty with sharper colors and better lighting to grab my attention, sorry.  Also, including the green in the lower right corner really doesn´t help and would never fly in a real advertisement for a ring as it only draws attention away from it.  Sorry but as it is I voted this a 3 but fix the lighting and image quality and you might be on to something.</td>', 'Well this would have been a nice shot but the image quality is pretty poor, it would have needed to be clearer, more contrasty with sharper colors and better lighting to grab my attention, sorry.  Also, including the green in the lower right corner really doesn´t help and would never fly in a real advertisement for a ring as it only draws attention away from it.  Sorry but as it is I voted this a 3 but fix the lighting and image quality and you might be on to something.', '2006-12-26 17:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150232, 440399, 66597, '<td valign="top">Although I like this photo a lot (perspective is especially strong) I had trouble associating it with the title. 7.</td>', 'Although I like this photo a lot (perspective is especially strong) I had trouble associating it with the title. 7.', '2006-12-26 17:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
