(3150325, 440037, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, think you could have done more with it though, waited a little bit till it was a bit darker to get a more stunning sky and maybe taken this from the ground up and also not cut off the people that are in the left of the shot so abruptly?  Good effort and got a 6 from me.</td>', 'Nice idea, think you could have done more with it though, waited a little bit till it was a bit darker to get a more stunning sky and maybe taken this from the ground up and also not cut off the people that are in the left of the shot so abruptly?  Good effort and got a 6 from me.', '2006-12-26 18:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150330, 440058, 27482, '<td valign="top">Yeah, tasteful, hehehehehe :)  Would have been even cooler if you had shoved your hand down there, that´s an idea I´ll let you have for "Pink Floyd II" :)</td>', 'Yeah, tasteful, hehehehehe :)  Would have been even cooler if you had shoved your hand down there, that´s an idea I´ll let you have for "Pink Floyd II" :)', '2006-12-26 18:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
