(3150346, 440251, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but I voted this a 3 and at least thought you deserved to know why.  95% of it is cause this shot is severely underexposed and noisy vastly beyond what I would find acceptable and the other 5% are the out of focus issues so it´s all just cause of poor image quality.<br/> <br/>I still like the idea behind it and the mood it conveys, I think you might be on to something and if I had processed this shot I would have made it monotone, thus kindof allowing for much noise and tried bringing a little bit more brigthness to it, maybe bringing out the eyes a bit?</td>', 'I am sorry but I voted this a 3 and at least thought you deserved to know why.  95% of it is cause this shot is severely underexposed and noisy vastly beyond what I would find acceptable and the other 5% are the out of focus issues so it´s all just cause of poor image quality. I still like the idea behind it and the mood it conveys, I think you might be on to something and if I had processed this shot I would have made it monotone, thus kindof allowing for much noise and tried bringing a little bit more brigthness to it, maybe bringing out the eyes a bit?', '2006-12-26 18:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
