(3150751, 439322, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but whether it is due to the post processing or something else, the look of this picture definately doesn´t appeal to me personally.  That sky or whatever it is in the backround just looks wierd and so does the person´s face, it´s like it´s blown out (in terms of highlights) and then darkened.  Just all around wierd coloring and looks like you used some kind of trick filter on it.  Anyway, that resulted in me giving this a score of 2 and I just thought I should at least explain why.</td>', 'Sorry but whether it is due to the post processing or something else, the look of this picture definately doesn´t appeal to me personally.  That sky or whatever it is in the backround just looks wierd and so does the person´s face, it´s like it´s blown out (in terms of highlights) and then darkened.  Just all around wierd coloring and looks like you used some kind of trick filter on it.  Anyway, that resulted in me giving this a score of 2 and I just thought I should at least explain why.', '2006-12-26 21:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
