(3150811, 440604, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty nicely done, I know it is hard though but the slight motion of the girl kindof knocks it down a peg or two, I personally would have kept at it till I got a shot that had her completely still and with the "three guys" pretty much how they are.  I know how difficult that is but I still would have gone for that.  Dig the PP and lighting though so I gave it a 6.</td>', 'Pretty nicely done, I know it is hard though but the slight motion of the girl kindof knocks it down a peg or two, I personally would have kept at it till I got a shot that had her completely still and with the "three guys" pretty much how they are.  I know how difficult that is but I still would have gone for that.  Dig the PP and lighting though so I gave it a 6.', '2006-12-26 22:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
