(3150817, 439471, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this to me just seems like a poorly thought out snapshot, I think you can do much better, especially with the composition.  I would have either moved to the left or swung the camera that way to lose that rooftop in the lower right corner and also not had so much empty space towards the top of the picture, there really is no place for the eye to stop with this composition.  If you are new to photography, try reading up on the rule of thirds and use it for a while, if you are not and just experimenting with this shot, by all means ignore this advice :)</td>', 'Sorry but this to me just seems like a poorly thought out snapshot, I think you can do much better, especially with the composition.  I would have either moved to the left or swung the camera that way to lose that rooftop in the lower right corner and also not had so much empty space towards the top of the picture, there really is no place for the eye to stop with this composition.  If you are new to photography, try reading up on the rule of thirds and use it for a while, if you are not and just experimenting with this shot, by all means ignore this advice :)', '2006-12-26 22:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150818, 440304, 27482, '<td valign="top">This would have been a much stronger photograph if it the flame and tip of the match were in focus, also I don´t really care for the blown out flame, you need some lighting on that match to even it out.  3 from me.</td>', 'This would have been a much stronger photograph if it the flame and tip of the match were in focus, also I don´t really care for the blown out flame, you need some lighting on that match to even it out.  3 from me.', '2006-12-26 22:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
