(3150848, 439486, 27482, '<td valign="top">NO offense meant of course but when I first saw this shot, I just went looking all over for the subject of this photo and found nothing of interest.  Simply put, I view this photo and think to myself "this is a photo of nothing".  Had you included something, like a boat, bridge, cliff or the sun rising it would have been a different matter :)  As it is though it´s hard to vote this anything but a 5 as it´s hardly bad but not good either.  Oh and a friendly pice of advice unless  you plainly forgot or didn´t have time, try to fix slanted horizons next time, they tend to drag your scores down here at DPC :)</td>', 'NO offense meant of course but when I first saw this shot, I just went looking all over for the subject of this photo and found nothing of interest.  Simply put, I view this photo and think to myself "this is a photo of nothing".  Had you included something, like a boat, bridge, cliff or the sun rising it would have been a different matter :)  As it is though it´s hard to vote this anything but a 5 as it´s hardly bad but not good either.  Oh and a friendly pice of advice unless  you plainly forgot or didn´t have time, try to fix slanted horizons next time, they tend to drag your scores down here at DPC :)', '2006-12-26 22:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150850, 439844, 27482, '<td valign="top">I dunno, I kindof dig the use of negative here, very surreal.  6</td>', 'I dunno, I kindof dig the use of negative here, very surreal.  6', '2006-12-26 22:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150852, 439000, 27482, '<td valign="top">Really dig the reflection in the guitar, only nitpick is I would have cropped out a bit at the top and right side of the frame to eliminate some of that backround but I dig this, also the lighting is good. 7</td>', 'Really dig the reflection in the guitar, only nitpick is I would have cropped out a bit at the top and right side of the frame to eliminate some of that backround but I dig this, also the lighting is good. 7', '2006-12-26 22:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150853, 439053, 27482, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit flat for my taste, a boost in the contrast here would have improved my score.</td>', 'Image is a bit flat for my taste, a boost in the contrast here would have improved my score.', '2006-12-26 22:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150858, 439536, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I dig that sky and clarity is top notch, great colors.  Only thing is I feel like this has been shoehorned into the challenge by use of the title, I only deducted a point though.</td>', 'Nicely done, I dig that sky and clarity is top notch, great colors.  Only thing is I feel like this has been shoehorned into the challenge by use of the title, I only deducted a point though.', '2006-12-26 22:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150859, 438882, 70459, '<td valign="top">good recreation, now that''s some ''bad bokeh''!</td>', 'good recreation, now that''s some ''bad bokeh''!', '2006-12-26 22:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150861, 440461, 27482, '<td valign="top">No kidding!  Who would drag out a piano and office chair in the middle of the street to play!  Hehe, people can be strange :)  Great shot, wish there was a strong face in there somewhere for me to really relate to this shot, that is the reason I am "only" voting a 7 for this.</td>', 'No kidding!  Who would drag out a piano and office chair in the middle of the street to play!  Hehe, people can be strange :)  Great shot, wish there was a strong face in there somewhere for me to really relate to this shot, that is the reason I am "only" voting a 7 for this.', '2006-12-26 22:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150863, 438171, 70459, '<td valign="top">if the leaves had been a bit more in the sun...</td>', 'if the leaves had been a bit more in the sun...', '2006-12-26 22:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150864, 440522, 27482, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a much stronger photograph if the house had been composed according to the rule of thirds.</td>', 'I think this would have been a much stronger photograph if the house had been composed according to the rule of thirds.', '2006-12-26 22:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150869, 440610, 70459, '<td valign="top">a novel interpretation at least...</td>', 'a novel interpretation at least...', '2006-12-26 22:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150871, 440462, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting but could have been better, I especially find the lack of lighting on the face to be the thing I wouldhave worked most on here.  Also, the pose and probably choice of lens makes her right arm/elbow seem a bit big compared to the rest of her (wich I am 100% sure is not the case with this beautiful, well proportioned young lady) so I might want to suggest a slightly longer telephoto lens to even that out.  Nice job anyway, got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice lighting but could have been better, I especially find the lack of lighting on the face to be the thing I wouldhave worked most on here.  Also, the pose and probably choice of lens makes her right arm/elbow seem a bit big compared to the rest of her (wich I am 100% sure is not the case with this beautiful, well proportioned young lady) so I might want to suggest a slightly longer telephoto lens to even that out.  Nice job anyway, got a 7 from me.', '2006-12-26 22:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150874, 438942, 27482, '<td valign="top">I really dig this shot, well composed and very mystical, makes me wish I was there (a little Floyd wordplay there, hehe).  Normally I would have said more contrast as it is a bit flat but I think that would have taken away some of the mystery with this shot.  Awesome work and went straight for my favorites.</td>', 'I really dig this shot, well composed and very mystical, makes me wish I was there (a little Floyd wordplay there, hehe).  Normally I would have said more contrast as it is a bit flat but I think that would have taken away some of the mystery with this shot.  Awesome work and went straight for my favorites.', '2006-12-26 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150877, 439410, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but to me this is just an out of focus, blurry mess and nothing I find visually/aesthetically pleasing so I voted it a 3.</td>', 'Sorry but to me this is just an out of focus, blurry mess and nothing I find visually/aesthetically pleasing so I voted it a 3.', '2006-12-26 22:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150879, 440614, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the editing, I dig the blue cast to this shot.</td>', 'Nice job with the editing, I dig the blue cast to this shot.', '2006-12-26 22:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150888, 440548, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this is pretty disturbing but powerful so it at least go to me.  Biggest qualm I have with it is the lack of image quality (mostly sharpness and coice of color scheme along with low contrast) but like I said, powerful.</td>', 'Well this is pretty disturbing but powerful so it at least go to me.  Biggest qualm I have with it is the lack of image quality (mostly sharpness and coice of color scheme along with low contrast) but like I said, powerful.', '2006-12-26 22:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150889, 439844, 70459, '<td valign="top">might have worked better with some more subtle editing</td>', 'might have worked better with some more subtle editing', '2006-12-26 22:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150905, 440522, 70459, '<td valign="top">yes it''s empty... but it doesn''t really say much</td>', 'yes it''s empty... but it doesn''t really say much', '2006-12-26 22:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150918, 440463, 53147, '<td valign="top">Back to comment. One of my top picks for the challenge. Great colors and just a really nice layout overall. Bumping up 1.</td>', 'Back to comment. One of my top picks for the challenge. Great colors and just a really nice layout overall. Bumping up 1.', '2006-12-26 22:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3150926, 440327, 53147, '<td valign="top">Well if this doesnt win then there is something seriously wrong. Excellent image and a very Floydian feel to it. Ohioan too - feels Ohioan ;) Bumping to a 9 for now. I keep coming back to this one. Has it all and then some. Bumping to a 10 &amp; adding to my faves.</td>', 'Well if this doesnt win then there is something seriously wrong. Excellent image and a very Floydian feel to it. Ohioan too - feels Ohioan ;) Bumping to a 9 for now. I keep coming back to this one. Has it all and then some. Bumping to a 10 & adding to my faves.', '2006-12-26 22:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
