(3151243, 440463, 55838, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot - great perspective.  I had this pegged for top 3.  Still a great finish though - Congratulations.  So is that you or did you get some poor sap to freeze his butt off for you?!  : )  Adding to favorites - love this.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-27 06:54:01.</i></td>', 'Fantastic shot - great perspective.  I had this pegged for top 3.  Still a great finish though - Congratulations.  So is that you or did you get some poor sap to freeze his butt off for you?!  : )  Adding to favorites - love this.', '2006-12-27 00:27:32.000000', '2006-12-27 06:54:01.000000', 0),
(3151260, 440463, 53147, '<td valign="top">Hate it when I forget what window I am looking at. Great image. Really thought this was gonna ribbon. Wonder what would have happened had I given you a ten rather than the 9. Well done.</td>', 'Hate it when I forget what window I am looking at. Great image. Really thought this was gonna ribbon. Wonder what would have happened had I given you a ten rather than the 9. Well done.', '2006-12-27 00:29:20.000000', NULL, 0),
