(3152012, 440343, 50231, '<td valign="top">Yeah the cage is crazy! At work we get these in with a plastic lining and they hold silicone. We took out the lining on two of them and I inverted one on the other to make a perfect, weird cage.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-14 13:25:37.</i></td>', 'Yeah the cage is crazy! At work we get these in with a plastic lining and they hold silicone. We took out the lining on two of them and I inverted one on the other to make a perfect, weird cage.', '2006-12-27 01:50:24.000000', '2007-04-14 14:25:37.000000', 0),
(3152030, 440037, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is spectacularly beautiful. Do you know I''m a retired architectural photographer? I''d be happy to have this image in my portfolio, back in the day. I have GOT to get up to Boston and see that building. For that matter, how''s come you and Magnus have never come down to the Cape to visit my marshes with me? Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'This is spectacularly beautiful. Do you know I''m a retired architectural photographer? I''d be happy to have this image in my portfolio, back in the day. I have GOT to get up to Boston and see that building. For that matter, how''s come you and Magnus have never come down to the Cape to visit my marshes with me? Congrats on the ribbon!', '2006-12-27 01:52:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3152037, 440183, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautifully conceived and realized. The single water droplet is the grace note that elevates the image. Well done!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-27 01:54:04.</i></td>', 'Beautifully conceived and realized. The single water droplet is the grace note that elevates the image. Well done!', '2006-12-27 01:53:20.000000', '2006-12-27 01:54:04.000000', 0),
