(3152150, 440336, 48471, '<td valign="top">i liked this photo, i really did. the nice colours, the spiky shapes, the two blue lines on the top-right side...i was thinking that a more poetic title, like "wish you were here" or "shine you diamond" would fit better to this image, not something as concrete as money. now, after reading your (photographer´s) comments, i think i understand what you tried to achieve, and i must say you did quite some good job. but, to make it even better, i think you should´ve put the entire line of the lyric, not only the title.<br/>i wish you better luck on the next challenges.</td>', 'i liked this photo, i really did. the nice colours, the spiky shapes, the two blue lines on the top-right side...i was thinking that a more poetic title, like "wish you were here" or "shine you diamond" would fit better to this image, not something as concrete as money. now, after reading your (photographer´s) comments, i think i understand what you tried to achieve, and i must say you did quite some good job. but, to make it even better, i think you should´ve put the entire line of the lyric, not only the title.i wish you better luck on the next challenges.', '2006-12-27 02:13:17.000000', NULL, 0),
