(3153097, 440471, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos that if you entered it in some other contest (outside of DPC) it would probably do quite well (depending on the theme of course).<br/> <br/>I gave out three 9''s for this challenge and this was one of them.<br/> <br/>Perhaps because I wasn''t that tuned into Pink Floyd (have ''The Wall'' at home, but haven''t listened to it in MANY years) I took this photo at face value as fitting the challenge and a Pink Floyd theme.  Seems that many others didn''t connect with it for this challenge.  If the challenge was ''Seed'', ''Weed'', or even ''Bokeh'' it probably would have scored near the top.<br/> <br/>Reminds a little of the type of photo that <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=5112" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ursula</a> might take.  Took a peek at your ''favorites'' and noticed she wasn''t on your list.  Check out some of her work, if you like taking the kind of photo that you''ve entered in this challenge, you''ll find some photos of interest in her portfolio.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I just wanted to stop by and again, congratulate you on a fine photograph - I enjoyed it.  Take care.</td>', 'This is one of those photos that if you entered it in some other contest (outside of DPC) it would probably do quite well (depending on the theme of course). I gave out three 9''s for this challenge and this was one of them. Perhaps because I wasn''t that tuned into Pink Floyd (have ''The Wall'' at home, but haven''t listened to it in MANY years) I took this photo at face value as fitting the challenge and a Pink Floyd theme.  Seems that many others didn''t connect with it for this challenge.  If the challenge was ''Seed'', ''Weed'', or even ''Bokeh'' it probably would have scored near the top. Reminds a little of the type of photo that  ursula might take.  Took a peek at your ''favorites'' and noticed she wasn''t on your list.  Check out some of her work, if you like taking the kind of photo that you''ve entered in this challenge, you''ll find some photos of interest in her portfolio. Anyway, I just wanted to stop by and again, congratulate you on a fine photograph - I enjoyed it.  Take care.', '2006-12-27 09:58:17.000000', NULL, 0),
