(3153219, 439410, 3724, '<td valign="top"><br/> <br/>9 A challenge fav.....  the effect of the soft transparent/translucent components fit the title.  During voting and review I thought your "Wearing the Inside Out" might be a variation by Wink.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=435286" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/34113/thumb/435286.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/34113/thumb/435286.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/34113/thumb/435286.jpg"/></a></td>', ' 9 A challenge fav.....  the effect of the soft transparent/translucent components fit the title.  During voting and review I thought your "Wearing the Inside Out" might be a variation by Wink. ', '2006-12-27 10:45:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3153234, 439322, 66597, '<td valign="top">Bob,<br/>I like the rainbow effect behind your daughter, and also good composition (though I might have cropped a bit more off left side - feels a little long). This may have been over-sharpened a bit, and the saturation is definitely tweaked. This would have probably been stronger if you could have used advanced editing to pop the rainbow but not Gretchen''s features. All in all an interesting entry, though, and I love the expression :-)</td>', 'Bob,I like the rainbow effect behind your daughter, and also good composition (though I might have cropped a bit more off left side - feels a little long). This may have been over-sharpened a bit, and the saturation is definitely tweaked. This would have probably been stronger if you could have used advanced editing to pop the rainbow but not Gretchen''s features. All in all an interesting entry, though, and I love the expression :-)', '2006-12-27 10:52:31.000000', NULL, 0),
