(3153701, 438357, 36006, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pixl Mastr WannaB:</b></div><hr/><i> Clever, but wouldn''t it have made more sense to put the "secret" clippings <i>inside</i> the cup? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, the "secrets" are supposed to be on the saucer. That is the reason behind the title. Other wise it would of been called " A Cup full of Secrets".<br/> <br/>Also, my dof was purposeful. I wanted to have the eye see the ''secrets'' and just make out the soft image of a cup, and a spoon. The ''secrets'' and the ''saucer'' were more important than the cup, and spoon.</td>', 'Originally posted by Pixl Mastr WannaB: Clever, but wouldn''t it have made more sense to put the "secret" clippings inside the cup?   No, the "secrets" are supposed to be on the saucer. That is the reason behind the title. Other wise it would of been called " A Cup full of Secrets". Also, my dof was purposeful. I wanted to have the eye see the ''secrets'' and just make out the soft image of a cup, and a spoon. The ''secrets'' and the ''saucer'' were more important than the cup, and spoon.', '2006-12-27 14:06:31.000000', NULL, 0),
