(3153855, 438882, 47378, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get a chance to vote on this challenge, but I looked through them. When I saw this one, I thought "this is an EXCELLENT recreation of the album cover, but most folks here won''t get it". Unfortunately, I see I was right. Even though you didn''t get the votes you deserved, I think this was one of the best images in the competition as it relates to the subject. Abstract? Definitely. Fits the challenge? Perfectly. Well done.</td>', 'I didn''t get a chance to vote on this challenge, but I looked through them. When I saw this one, I thought "this is an EXCELLENT recreation of the album cover, but most folks here won''t get it". Unfortunately, I see I was right. Even though you didn''t get the votes you deserved, I think this was one of the best images in the competition as it relates to the subject. Abstract? Definitely. Fits the challenge? Perfectly. Well done.', '2006-12-27 15:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
