(3154137, 440037, 57060, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a great photo - really good score in a tough challenge. I really like the "negative space" - the ghoastly area of reflection and water, really plays nicely with the title and the lyrics. I think the timing and lighting was perfect. Too dark outside would have made the inside too strong. Fantastic job, congrats again.<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Congrats on a great photo - really good score in a tough challenge. I really like the "negative space" - the ghoastly area of reflection and water, really plays nicely with the title and the lyrics. I think the timing and lighting was perfect. Too dark outside would have made the inside too strong. Fantastic job, congrats again. Jack', '2006-12-27 17:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
