(3154313, 440303, 22517, '<td valign="top">Totally underrated, this was my favourite (but other beautiful pictures capturing the PF spirit as well). As soon as I saw the title I filled in the lyrics in my mind and it fits so well! Most "fitting to lyrics" photo IMO.</td>', 'Totally underrated, this was my favourite (but other beautiful pictures capturing the PF spirit as well). As soon as I saw the title I filled in the lyrics in my mind and it fits so well! Most "fitting to lyrics" photo IMO.', '2006-12-27 18:34:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154343, 438284, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a very strong photo -- very Pink Floyd. I gave it a 9. Not sure why I didn''t go all the way to 10, perhaps because it is disturbing to look at. But you got a lot of high scores and deserved them. (Who is that troll who leaves 2 on everything?) Good work, Kelly!</td>', 'This is a very strong photo -- very Pink Floyd. I gave it a 9. Not sure why I didn''t go all the way to 10, perhaps because it is disturbing to look at. But you got a lot of high scores and deserved them. (Who is that troll who leaves 2 on everything?) Good work, Kelly!', '2006-12-27 18:53:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154360, 440336, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice explanation of the thought behind your image ... I love the creative approach you took to the subject, and your rejection of just shooting a dollar bill was a great choice.  Now I get what you were trying to do.  Maybe next time take your thoughts a little further in exploring the images you want to create.  Keep it up.</td>', 'Nice explanation of the thought behind your image ... I love the creative approach you took to the subject, and your rejection of just shooting a dollar bill was a great choice.  Now I get what you were trying to do.  Maybe next time take your thoughts a little further in exploring the images you want to create.  Keep it up.', '2006-12-27 19:02:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154369, 440662, 66384, '<td valign="top">Are you still married? :) I would like to see this with the nose cropped off and the eyes right in the middle. The light on the bridge of the nose would echo the light on the forehead, and the composition might be very mysterious.</td>', 'Are you still married? :) I would like to see this with the nose cropped off and the eyes right in the middle. The light on the bridge of the nose would echo the light on the forehead, and the composition might be very mysterious.', '2006-12-27 19:05:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154409, 440636, 66384, '<td valign="top">Decent score and 7 ''10''s. Well deserved. I think you did and excellent job of illustrating that line. A red and blue Fighting Fish swimming gracefully would really have made this shot awesome, but that''s pie in the sky, because it would have messed up your souls.</td>', 'Decent score and 7 ''10''s. Well deserved. I think you did and excellent job of illustrating that line. A red and blue Fighting Fish swimming gracefully would really have made this shot awesome, but that''s pie in the sky, because it would have messed up your souls.', '2006-12-27 19:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
