(3154647, 440327, 20530, '<td valign="top">You are the King!!!</td>', 'You are the King!!!', '2006-12-27 21:14:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3154691, 440336, 30490, '<td valign="top">OK now that I have read your notes (very well written by the way!) I get what you were trying to do with this shot.  The thing about photography is that the image has to stand on its own to tell the story.  You put a lot of thought into your image, but it just didn''t get translated through to what the voters could see.  For this challenge, actually photographing money would have worked.  The lyrics of the song "Money" would have made the statement you were looking for.  It is a complex web we weave with the challenges and our images.  As I mentioned in my previous comment, as an impressionistic image this was a good photo, it just didn''t work for this specific challenge.  Keep working at your art, and I know since you put so much thought into your images I will eventually see you on the front page of DPC!</td>', 'OK now that I have read your notes (very well written by the way!) I get what you were trying to do with this shot.  The thing about photography is that the image has to stand on its own to tell the story.  You put a lot of thought into your image, but it just didn''t get translated through to what the voters could see.  For this challenge, actually photographing money would have worked.  The lyrics of the song "Money" would have made the statement you were looking for.  It is a complex web we weave with the challenges and our images.  As I mentioned in my previous comment, as an impressionistic image this was a good photo, it just didn''t work for this specific challenge.  Keep working at your art, and I know since you put so much thought into your images I will eventually see you on the front page of DPC!', '2006-12-27 21:38:07.000000', NULL, 0),
