(3159154, 440649, 6349, '<td valign="top">very pretty Joe your stuffs lookin very pro</td>', 'very pretty Joe your stuffs lookin very pro', '2006-12-29 10:32:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3159168, 440399, 6349, '<td valign="top">Reading some of the comments really makes me laugh, esp. one''s saying that they don''t understand the composition, suggesting that you move to the left, and those offering you better luck for next time.  I gave this a 9 simply because I can''t give everything a 10 and also maybe because of the white speck in the black part on the right that looks something like the reflection of a leaf.  Maybe if this was bigger I would actually like it but this small I think it takes away from the blackness.</td>', 'Reading some of the comments really makes me laugh, esp. one''s saying that they don''t understand the composition, suggesting that you move to the left, and those offering you better luck for next time.  I gave this a 9 simply because I can''t give everything a 10 and also maybe because of the white speck in the black part on the right that looks something like the reflection of a leaf.  Maybe if this was bigger I would actually like it but this small I think it takes away from the blackness.', '2006-12-29 10:37:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3159177, 439227, 16241, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot.</td>', 'fantastic shot.', '2006-12-29 10:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3159217, 440327, 24454, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe how awesome this is!  How perfectly it turned out just throwing those gloves out there like that with no string.  And positioned so perfectly without a tripod.  This not only deserves a  blue ribbon, but a place of honor in a gallery!!!   Congratulations!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I can''t believe how awesome this is!  How perfectly it turned out just throwing those gloves out there like that with no string.  And positioned so perfectly without a tripod.  This not only deserves a  blue ribbon, but a place of honor in a gallery!!!   Congratulations! ', '2006-12-29 11:00:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3159693, 440629, 20941, '<td valign="top">soooooooooooooooo floyd</td>', 'soooooooooooooooo floyd', '2006-12-29 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3160052, 440456, 50641, '<td valign="top">F#&amp;*ing fantastic entry - one of my top picks, 9 from me.  Clinched the mood perfectly.</td>', 'F#&*ing fantastic entry - one of my top picks, 9 from me.  Clinched the mood perfectly.', '2006-12-29 15:33:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3160545, 439227, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really love the absurdity of this shot (if you''ll forgive me). The way that the bench almost looks too small and the way that it seems to be giving way under your (?) weight appeal to my sense of humour. The symmetry is quite striking, too.</td>', 'I really love the absurdity of this shot (if you''ll forgive me). The way that the bench almost looks too small and the way that it seems to be giving way under your (?) weight appeal to my sense of humour. The symmetry is quite striking, too.', '2006-12-29 18:26:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3160706, 440399, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha. Ha ha ha again. Laughs himself to the point of not being able to drink any more of his St Emilion. Someone - and a fine judge at that - mistook your work for mine. <br/> <br/>Interesting how the appearance of a line can so finely depend on your perspective - there''s arguably a lesson for all those who''d like to change your point of view there.</td>', 'Ha ha ha. Ha ha ha again. Laughs himself to the point of not being able to drink any more of his St Emilion. Someone - and a fine judge at that - mistook your work for mine.  Interesting how the appearance of a line can so finely depend on your perspective - there''s arguably a lesson for all those who''d like to change your point of view there.', '2006-12-29 19:45:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3161050, 440632, 7628, '<td valign="top">Hey who is that fantastic woman in your picture?  No, not the one on the wall!<br/>;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-03 21:37:47.</i></td>', 'Hey who is that fantastic woman in your picture?  No, not the one on the wall!;-)', '2006-12-29 22:04:46.000000', '2007-01-03 21:37:47.000000', 0),
