(3193697, 440649, 55221, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! As always, your work astounds me. I will make two humble critiques, however. It does not really make sense that the girl is holding a lantern in daylight. Also, the cropping on the left side is sort of awkward. But, I am a hypocrite when it comes to cropping.</td>', 'Beautiful! As always, your work astounds me. I will make two humble critiques, however. It does not really make sense that the girl is holding a lantern in daylight. Also, the cropping on the left side is sort of awkward. But, I am a hypocrite when it comes to cropping.', '2007-01-08 00:16:53.000000', NULL, 0),
