(3491659, 440604, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this so much!  I just stumbled across it, and have been studying it and studying it. It is mesmerizing.<br/> <br/>I don''t know. . .I read a few complainers about her face not being sharp enough. . . but for the title, and the concept you were trying to convey. . .I think a face that''s ever-so-slightly out of sorts fits as if it were intentional and PERFECT!  For me. . .just as well as if it were crystal clear.<br/> <br/>This is just totally awesome.  I don''t know why it didn''t get all 9''s and 10''s!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love this so much!  I just stumbled across it, and have been studying it and studying it. It is mesmerizing. I don''t know. . .I read a few complainers about her face not being sharp enough. . . but for the title, and the concept you were trying to convey. . .I think a face that''s ever-so-slightly out of sorts fits as if it were intentional and PERFECT!  For me. . .just as well as if it were crystal clear. This is just totally awesome.  I don''t know why it didn''t get all 9''s and 10''s! ', '2007-03-27 19:08:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3493549, 438284, 76027, '<td valign="top">Yeah, definitely a very strong and emotional picture.<br/>I wish I was an albatross! heh. Childhood''s End is my favorite song by Pink Floyd.<br/>"You awake with a start to just the beating of your heart.<br/>Just one man beneath the sky,<br/>Just two ears, just two eyes.<br/>You set sail across the sea of longpast thoughts and memories.<br/>Childhood''s end,<br/>Your fantasies merge with harsh realities."<br/> <br/></td>', 'Yeah, definitely a very strong and emotional picture.I wish I was an albatross! heh. Childhood''s End is my favorite song by Pink Floyd."You awake with a start to just the beating of your heart.Just one man beneath the sky,Just two ears, just two eyes.You set sail across the sea of longpast thoughts and memories.Childhood''s end,Your fantasies merge with harsh realities." ', '2007-03-28 10:05:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3548701, 440343, 28742, '<td valign="top">So I have visited the GrandWaz''s portfolio for awhile and I see this 9th place entry and just wanna say congrats! I see some technical details in your notes, but no friggin explanation of what I am looking at! ;-) Is that you? Do you have ''big hand gloves'' ?? (gotta get me some) and you have a big cage? Could use one of those too. <br/> <br/>Nice job man!</td>', 'So I have visited the GrandWaz''s portfolio for awhile and I see this 9th place entry and just wanna say congrats! I see some technical details in your notes, but no friggin explanation of what I am looking at! ;-) Is that you? Do you have ''big hand gloves'' ?? (gotta get me some) and you have a big cage? Could use one of those too.  Nice job man!', '2007-04-15 04:28:47.000000', NULL, 0),
